&lt;p&gt;Scopely has global operations and partners across four continents in more than a dozen countries worldwide. For more information, visit: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scopely.com/&quot;&gt;https://www.scopely.com/&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notice to Candidates: Scopely will never request payment or financial information during the application or hiring process. Please apply only through our official &lt;a href=&quot;http://scopely.com&quot;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt; and verify that all Talent Partner communications come from an email address ending in @&lt;a href=&quot;http://scopely.com&quot;&gt;scopely.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Should you have any questions or encounter any fraudulent requests/emails/websites, please immediately contact ----- Our job applicant privacy policies are available here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scopely.com/en/job-applicant-privacy-notice-for-ca-residents&quot;&gt;California Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scopely.com/en/eea-and-uk-job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;EEA/UK Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Employment at Scopely is based solely on a person&#39;s merit and qualifications. Scopely does not discriminate against any employee or applicant because of race, creed, color, religion, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity/expression, national origin, disability, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, pregnancy or related condition (including breastfeeding), or any other basis protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records, consistent with applicable federal, state and local law.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Introduction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Are you a recent or soon-to-be graduate in physics, engineering or a related field, keen to apply your technical appreciation of physics and engineering to guide investment and business choices in the telecommunication&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; sector? Are you fascinated by the changing way we communicate and share information and want to shape the future? Do you have a curious mindset and the drive to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;uncover challenges in making telecommunication&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; technologies and processes work at a cost and scale that makes sense?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If so, then this could be a great role for you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;4gf4p&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;93fl2-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;93fl2-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;93fl2-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Successful candidates can join us between May and October 2027.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;4gf4p&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;3cvnq-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;3cvnq-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;3cvnq-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;There is no deadline for this role, as we recruit on a rolling basis. We encourage you to apply as soon as possible.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Who we are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Advisory team works at the forefront of emerging technology, helping organisations turn innovation into commercial success. Although this role will spend most of its time supporting clients in the telecommunications sector, we encourage our consultants to bring their expertise across industries, particularly in areas where communications, infrastructure and energy are becoming increasingly intercon&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;nected.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll work with a wide range of organisations, from fast-growing technology pioneers and infrastructure providers to telecoms operators and investors. Together, we help clients navigate uncertainty, evaluate opportunities and make informed strategic judgements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Projects typically involve assessing new markets, understanding competitive landscapes, shaping go-to-market strategies, supporting investment judgements and exploring future technology pathways. Our work covers cutting-edge technologies including direct-to-device services, non-terrestrial networks, high-altitude platform systems (HAPS) and emerging space-based communications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A critical part of Cambridge Consultants, o&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;ur Advisory &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; delivers projects to clients in the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Telecommunication&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;s&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;sector. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our clients vary from &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;ambitious &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;start-ups to multinationals,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;but all a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;spire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; to use cutting-edge&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;telecommunication &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;technology to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;transform and innovate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; What we do is help them succeed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our work delivers insights for key business choices related to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;de&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;ep &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;tech: developing go-to-market strategies, providing investment support, competitor analyses, market insights&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; technology road-mapping&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; and strategic foresight&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;. The technologies we work with are broad and include the latest advances &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; lunar comms, direct&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;device and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;high-altitude pseudo-satellites (HAPS)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The role sits within the ‘Research &amp;amp; Insights’ section of our Advisory group, which focuses on understanding how the near- and long-term future impacts the choices we make today. Examples include: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;W&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;w&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;hat are the next&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;generation satellite&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; services? How will terrestrial and satellite services seamlessly integrate? How &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;can &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;new technology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;can &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;connect unconnected regions while remaining commercially viable?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;3&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work on diverse, high-impact telecoms projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; for a global client base&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;3&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Apply diverse approaches&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; to help clients unlock new sources of value across products, services and operations, including&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;AI-enabled approaches&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;3&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Collaborate with experts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;engineering, science, product design &amp;amp; realisation and business &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;teams&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;to craft strategies that unlock commercial and societal value from deep tech&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;3&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Analyse markets, technologies and business models&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; to help clients navigate complexity, seize opportunities and anticipate threats&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;3&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Contribute to thought leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; on how deep tech can solve global challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
