&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;For this position we can only accept applications that include a covering letter.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
