&lt;h3&gt;Recruiting Agencies: CHAOS Industries does not accept unsolicited resumes or outreach. Unsolicited submissions will not be reviewed or compensated.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-onsite&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Every mind is unique. Yet much of the world is still built for what’s considered &quot;normal,&quot; leaving too many people behind. At Everway, we change that by creating technology that helps everyone understand and be understood. By understanding and addressing the unique needs of each individual, we&#39;re creating a world where differences are recognized and valued.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our careers fit real life. When you join us, you’re not just taking a job. You’re joining a movement to build a more neuroinclusive world. We’re a global community of over 800 employees spanning North America, UK, Europe, Australia, and New Zealand. A career here is purposeful and fast-moving, with clear expectations, modern tools, and the clarity to focus on what matters most.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our people are supported and encouraged to show up as they are, with different ways of thinking welcomed and valued. We pride ourselves on our core values that are embedded within our culture. These are to &lt;strong&gt;be curious, have courage, and commit fully&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us at Everway - together, we can unlock the full potential of every mind.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everway is building a modern data capability to help teams make better decisions across the business. As a Data Analyst, you&#39;ll work with colleagues across Information Systems and other functions to transform data into meaningful insight that supports operational, commercial and product decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be part of our Data Team, helping maintain high-quality data, developing reporting, and identifying trends that enable the business to act with confidence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collect, clean and analyse data from a variety of sources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help maintain data quality, accuracy and consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain data models, dashboards and reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with stakeholders to understand data requirements and business questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse trends and patterns to generate actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present findings clearly to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support data-driven initiatives across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the design and implementation of data-driven solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep up to date with developments in data analysis tools and best practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Criteria&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree or equivalent practical experience in a quantitative discipline such as mathematics, statistics, computer science or software engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years&#39; experience in a Data Analyst or similar role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with SQL, Excel and at least one analytical programming language such as Python or R.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of data modelling and statistical analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating dashboards and visualisations using tools such as Tableau, Power BI or Looker Studio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicates clearly with technical and non-technical stakeholders and works effectively with colleagues across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates attention to detail and a commitment to producing accurate, reliable data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable Criteria&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Databricks or similar data platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in an agile environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within the education technology sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Confluence or a similar documentation platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI tools to improve analysis, reporting or workflow efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#everway&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join our team and enjoy a competitive salary with bonus opportunities, flexible work schedules, and comprehensive health and wellness benefits. We offer flexible time off plans, career growth through development programs, and a collaborative, innovative culture where your ideas matter.&amp;nbsp; Ready to make an impact? Apply today and be part of a company that invests in your success!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to providing a Drug-Free Workplace for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, disability status, protected veteran status or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can view our Recruitment and Selection Policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1yDxHyVbhh8MK9NnCYdnEAfVSO4rhPCovVbKK8ecxT4U/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please click the link for our &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uAKvHVSRsqZ83CGhM3_3Dc6RPsXwlTdmwdUH7msHkVM/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Production&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;We are WPP Production - the unified global production company that brings together all of WPP&#39;s content producers, studios and craft experts into one connected organisation. We combine world-class human craft with next generation technology to originate, design, and deliver multi-channel content systems at scale. Built for borderless collaboration and powered by deep craft expertise, we are the production engine designed for today&#39;s always on, AI driven marketing world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http://wpp.com/__;!!JboVxjCXSME!N9KGoZIn5nCC-uOWhEdE-ChrrJuf6TgkLzNNkLaW9BExJsVqZZ_hMSmGbARJ0tdBOnKYM7kEbv5L3ncUpg7-6uEPNdY$&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;6ded86b6-cde3-4e48-958d-34727f881edd&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Hybrid working model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What does an Account Director do at WPP Production?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;About the Role&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Account Director to lead the day-to-day management of the Beauty Luxury account within WPP Production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Acting as the primary point of contact for client stakeholders, this role will sit at the heart of the operation, translating business needs into actionable delivery plans, triaging incoming briefs, managing workload prioritisation and ensuring the right resources are allocated to deliver exceptional work on time and on budget.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will bring strong account leadership, operational rigour and stakeholder management skills, ensuring seamless collaboration between clients, creative teams, production teams and specialist capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the day-to-day client lead for the client stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Business Director to build trusted relationships across brand, marketing and operations teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead regular status meetings, work-in-progress reviews and governance sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Business Director to manage stakeholder expectations, escalations and issue resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Client Delivery Lead to own the end-to-end intake process for all incoming briefs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure briefs contain all necessary information before entering production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Client Delivery Lead to prioritise work based on business objectives, SLAs and resource availability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain visibility of team capacity and forecast upcoming demand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage freelance or specialist resource requirements during peak periods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage projects from brief through to final delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify scope changes and prepare OOS estimates for client sign off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support forecasting, reporting and financial reconciliation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Business Director to contribute to commercial discussions and growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Essential&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in Account Management or Client Services within an agency, production or marketing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing complex stakeholder groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong resource management and workflow planning capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience overseeing high-volume creative and content production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisational and commercial acumen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritise competing demands in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Preferred&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within beauty, luxury, retail or FMCG sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of creative production, content creation and adaptation workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with integrated agency teams and offshore production models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with workflow and project management platforms such as Wrike&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting operational transformation programmes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI - HYBRID&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI - RH1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why work here:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;At WPP Production, you’ll help shape the future of content production at a truly global scale. We bring together world-class talent, cutting-edge studios, and advanced technology to solve some of the most complex creative and production challenges in the industry. You’ll work in a collaborative, borderless environment where craft excellence is valued, innovation is encouraged, and AI and next-generation tools are used to amplify not replace human creativity. With access to diverse projects, global career opportunities, and the backing of WPP’s unmatched network, this is a place where you can grow your skills, make real impact, and create work that performs for every audience, across every channel, at every moment. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion and Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers. &lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on legitimate interest as a legal basis for processing personal information under the GDPR for purposes of recruitment and applications for employment. When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button at the bottom of this page, this will send all the information you have added to WPP Production. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our Privacy&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hogarthww.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;st&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hogarth.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;atement&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please contact &lt;a ----- ----- if you need the job advert or form in another format.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Since 2004, we’ve been bringing investment ideas to life and connecting capital with the right people and opportunities. Today, we manage more than £2.5 billion for a broad range of investors across five key investment strategies: Private Credit,&amp;nbsp;Social Housing, Clean Heat, Energy and Venture. These strategies underpin the innovative range of investments we offer to both private (retail) and institutional clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;There are 230+ employees at Triple Point, all committed to leaving the world demonstrably better than we found it. That’s why we’re a certified B Corp, signed up to the Principles for Responsible Investment, and were named a Sunday Times &lt;em&gt;&#39;Best Place to Work&amp;nbsp; 2025 &amp;amp; 2026&#39;&lt;/em&gt;. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;I&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;f this sounds like an environment where you would flourish, then read on…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;table width=&quot;642&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;642&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Function &amp;amp; Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Relationship Services team is Triple Point Private Credit&#39;s &lt;strong&gt;SME Portfolio team&lt;/strong&gt;. The team manages borrower relationships across SME Debt Finance, Specialty Finance and Fund Finance, ensuring strong portfolio performance, assessing in-life credit events, and supporting high-quality client outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;642&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Purpose&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Relationship Director (RD) leads some of the team’s most complex and high-value SME borrower relationships, with a particular focus on sponsor-backed leveraged and acquisition finance. The role carries significant autonomy, requiring mature credit judgement, strong relationship leadership, and the ability to structure and execute sophisticated transactions that support strong portfolio outcomes and commercial value creation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The RD also plays a critical leadership role within the team coaching junior colleagues, shaping best practice, and deputising for the Head of Relationship Services where required.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;642&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Portfolio &amp;amp; Relationship Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own, lead and strategically manage a portfolio of high-value, complex borrowers, focusing on sponsor-backed leveraged/acquisition finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain regular, senior-level communication with borrowers, sponsors, advisers and management teams to strengthen long-term relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the onboarding process for new clients (in partnership with Origination), and ensure smooth handover of deteriorating credits to Restructuring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk, Compliance &amp;amp; Monitoring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take full accountability for portfolio compliance: MI receipt, covenant testing, reporting accuracy, escalation and early identification of risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor acquisition facilities, including reviewing pipeline acquisitions, assessing covenant headroom, and approving/declining draw requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review management information, interrogate financial performance, and update senior stakeholders as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Credit, Restructuring &amp;amp; In-Life Transaction Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead all borrower in-life events, including forbearance, restructures, covenant resets, new money requests and negotiations with sponsors/advisers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure transactions, draft term sheets, prepare high-quality credit papers and present recommendations to Credit Forum/Investment Committee.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Annual Reviews end-to-end, ensuring timely and accurate analysis and approval.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal Execution &amp;amp; Documentation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead negotiations and documentation processes for new lending and amendments, coordinating with internal legal, external counsel and credit colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure execution is timely, commercially sound, risk-aligned and operationally smooth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership, Coaching &amp;amp; Team Contribution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Line manage Associate Directors and Portfolio Managers: allocate work, develop capability and provide feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior escalation point, providing guidance on complex cases and supporting junior colleagues’ development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deputise for the Head of Relationship Services as required (team meetings, strategic forums, cross-functional working groups).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead project work that supports the team’s wider strategic goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Portfolio Management &amp;amp; Value Creation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adopt a strategic, forward-looking approach to portfolio optimisation, identifying opportunities for new lending, fee generation and value enhancement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate with significant autonomy, requiring limited oversight, while keeping senior stakeholders informed where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;642&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in sponsor-backed leveraged finance, with proven track record in portfolio management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience negotiating and executing LMA-style facility agreements, security and intercreditor documents, and committed acquisition facilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience managing complex borrower relationships and leading new lending transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong financial modelling capability, including leveraged case modelling, covenant analysis and scenario testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the commercial lending landscape (pricing, competitors, structures).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree educated; professional qualifications in accountancy, banking or risk management (advantageous).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with restructures, covenant breaches or forbearance processes (advantageous).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;642&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently with senior-level autonomy while collaborating effectively with key stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills; confident engaging with senior management teams, sponsors and advisers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisation and project management, with ability to manage multiple complex workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, solutions-focused, results-driven attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Constructive challenge mindset; willing to question assumptions and drive better outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinker with balanced judgement across risk, value and client outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership capability, coaching and developing junior talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;642&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a part of a&lt;strong&gt; forward-thinking, growing&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;innovative&lt;/strong&gt; company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with a talented and&lt;strong&gt; driven&lt;/strong&gt; team in a collaborative and connected environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and comprehensive &lt;strong&gt;benefits&lt;/strong&gt; package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for&lt;strong&gt; professional development&lt;/strong&gt; and career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;642&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High Performance at Triple Point&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;High Performance at Triple Point means living our values at the top of your game.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our five values are below, you can read more on our website about how we embed our values to drive a high-performance culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Stay Curious&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Be Generous&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Take Thoughtful Action&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Pull Together&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;·&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; Own It&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In line with our values&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Stay Curious&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Take Thoughtful Action&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;every employee has access to AI tools. We see technology as a co-pilot, helping us improve efficiency and insight while keeping decisions grounded in thoughtful human judgement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Triple Point offers a wealth of benefits including a contributory pension, hybrid/flexible working and ongoing learning and development opportunities. Check out our comprehensive list of benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.triplepoint.co.uk/careers/42/&quot;&gt;HERE&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today for further information!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Triple Point is dedicated to providing fair and equal opportunities for all individuals, including both current and potential employees. Discrimination of any kind based on factors such as age, disability, gender, sexual orientation, pregnancy, race, ethnicity, religion, gender identity, or marital status is not tolerated by the company.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our aim is to create a welcoming and diverse work environment where people from all walks of life feel valued and supported. We actively encourage individuals from various backgrounds to apply for job vacancies and become part of our team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://triplepoint-my.sharepoint.com/:i:/g/personal/michelle_cowell_triplepoint_co_uk/Edi4UkSOPCFCleTaQ7TONfgByul8Y-u39x5vZCCh-yf_Kg?e=3TA8dB&quot; alt=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;STRICTLY NO AGENCIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;You can find a link to our candidate privacy notice&lt;strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.triplepoint.co.uk/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;HERE.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join the company that’s building the telemetry infrastructure for the AI era. At Cribl, we partner with IT and Security teams at many of the world’s biggest enterprises, including half of the Fortune 100, to bridge the gap between AI ambition and infrastructure reality. As the AI Platform for Telemetry, we give customers the choice, control, and flexibility to manage and analyze telemetry for both humans and agents, so they can build what’s next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re one of the fastest‑growing private companies and a leading player in a massive, fast‑moving market. With a global workforce, we’re remote‑first and grounded in a simple idea: software is a people business. Cribl is the place where curious, collaborative people can do their best work, grow fast, and bring their full selves to the herd.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You’ll Love This Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Public Sector Enterprise Regional Sales Manager who is ambitious, adaptable, and enthusiastic. A successful Enterprise Regional Sales Manager at Cribl will clearly articulate our value proposition and execute on proven sales processes. This Regional Sales Manager will come with accountability and ownership, specifically in meeting leading indicators. Most importantly, we put our customers first, always. We are looking for an Account Executive who will do just that. The ideal candidate will come with expertise in creating customer centric solutions, and be able to build strong enduring relationships with our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As An Active Member Of Our Team, You Will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on a Public Sector Territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a business plan to overachieve sales goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and maintain the entire sales ecosystem from generating leads through closing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help customers understand the value of Cribl during the sales process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Articulate our value proposition up and down the organization, from engineer up to CxO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecasting predictably and hitting sales targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are a remote-first company and work happens across many time-zones – you may be required to occasionally perform duties outside your standard working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;I&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;f You’ve Got It - We Want It&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of quota carrying Public Sector Enterprise Security sales experience calling on Security (SIEM &amp;amp; Observability) &amp;amp; IT Personas (CISO/CIO’s)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with at least one earlier stage start-up organization &amp;lt;1000 employees or has demonstrated entrepreneurial skills throughout their career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of landing 5+ new logos each year and demonstrated ability to run a complex sales process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling through a channel led motion&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to create demand in a territory and selling un-budgeted solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background using MEDDIC&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-GC1&lt;br&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring Your Whole Self&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Diversity drives innovation, enables better decisions to support our customers, and inspires change for the better. We’re building a culture where differences are valued and welcomed, and we work together to bring out the best in each other. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, or any other applicable legally protected characteristics in the location in which the candidate is applying.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Interested in joining the Cribl herd? Learn more about the smartest, funniest, most passionate goats you’ll ever meet at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cribl.io/about-us/&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;cribl.io/about-us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;About THG Ingenuity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;THG Ingenuity is a fully integrated digital commerce ecosystem, designed to power brands without limits. Our global end-to-end tech platform is comprised of three products: THG Commerce, THG Studios, THG Fulfilment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each represents a single, unified solution, overcoming challenges and taking brands direct-to-consumer. Our client portfolio includes globally recognised brands such as Coca-Cola, Nestle, Elemis, Homebase, and Proctor &amp;amp; Gamble.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a broad-based analyst role sitting at the intersection of financial planning, commercial analysis, and business partnering. Reporting into the Head of Commercial Finance, the successful candidate will sit at the heart of the business, building a full P&amp;amp;L view across the group&#39;s divisions and understanding the commercial and operational drivers behind the numbers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role suits someone analytically strong who enjoys varied work and can operate comfortably across both structured financial processes and more ambiguous commercial situations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;FP&amp;amp;A&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the weekly forecast and month-end close process, coordinate and check BU submissions, produce packs with variance analysis and commentary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support reforecast cycles, coordinating inputs from budget holders and consolidating into management reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support cashflow and balance sheet modelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support with the co-ordination and completion of the monthly board pack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain financial models to support planning and scenario analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to process improvement initiatives within the finance function (e.g. automation/AI)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Commercial Finance &amp;amp; Business Partnering&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide commercial analysis and challenge on contract pricing, renewals, and new business proposals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with operational and commercial teams, presenting analysis to build credibility as a trusted finance contact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain exposure to the review and drafting of commercial contract clauses, working alongside legal and commercial teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the maintenance of the centralised CLM database&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead ad hoc analysis on business performance, client profitability, or commercial trends as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualified accountant (ACA, ACCA, CIMA)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in an FP&amp;amp;A, commercial finance, or management accounting environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Excel skills, comfortable building financial models from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident communicator, able to present analysis clearly to both finance and non-finance stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous improvement mindset, challenges and suggests ways to improve existing processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in a fast-paced, high-growth environment where priorities shift and pace matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG Ingenuity is proud to be a Disability Confident Committed employer. If you are invited to interview, please let us know if there are any reasonable adjustments we can make to the recruitment process that will enable you to perform to the best of your ability.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG Ingenuity is committed to creating a diverse &amp;amp; inclusive environment and hence welcomes applications from all sections of the community.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Because of the high volumes of applications our opportunities attract, it sometimes takes us time to review and consider them all. We endeavour to respond to every application we receive within 14 days. If you haven&#39;t heard from us within that time frame or should you have any specific questions about this or other applications for positions at THG Ingenuity please contact one of our &lt;span class=&quot;mark75xs2u5gf&quot; data-markjs=&quot;true&quot; data-ogac=&quot;&quot; data-ogab=&quot;&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;&quot;&gt;Talent&lt;/span&gt; team to discuss further.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernization, connecting strategy directly to execution. Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses. VML, part of WPP, supports WPP Enterprise Solutions by helping brands activate transformation through creativity and experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;The Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Growth Managing Director, you will own a defined enterprise growth domain and are personally accountable for hunting, triaging, shaping and progressing live WPP Enterprise Solutions opportunities within it. Large organisations create ambiguity. Your job is not to manage it internally; it is to resolve it commercially.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an active commercial role, not a strategic advisory one. You sit close to live client work, and your value is measured by the momentum you create: turning relationships, market signals and direct client needs into qualified, moving ES opportunities. You are a senior commercial operator who does not wait for a brief to arrive in its final form or for the organisation to clear a path before you act. You find the signal, you qualify it, you shape it, and you drive it forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is as much for the person ready to step into full commercial ownership as it is for the seasoned enterprise growth operator. What we are looking for is not a specific tenure; it is a specific kind of commercial maturity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Core Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Identify &amp;amp; Qualify:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a defined area of Enterprise Growth, such as WPP Media, WPP Creative, GCL / Top Accounts, WPP Open / Data / AI, Enterprise Growth Architecture, Commercial Architecture or Solution Architecture and take personal accountability for everything that moves within it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively identify and pursue ES growth opportunities through WPP relationships, direct client signals, agency teams, GCLs, platform opportunities, partner motions and enterprise transformation needs, not waiting for leads to come to you, but going to find them before anyone else has&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly and consistently with client leaders, GCLs, agency leaders, media and creative leadership, consulting teams, partner teams and ES capability owners; building the kind of trust that means you are called first, not copied in later&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Shape &amp;amp; Pursue:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess opportunity fit, revenue potential, urgency, readiness, route to client, stakeholder access, competitive context and activation requirements, with the rigour and speed to know quickly what to pursue, what to park and what to pass on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create clear problem statements, opportunity briefs, points of view, value hypotheses, stakeholder maps and pursuit recommendations, giving live opportunities the strategic structure and narrative they need to move forward with confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead discovery, workshops, executive conversations, proposal direction, credentials, pilots and pitch development where needed, owning the early stages that determine whether an opportunity gains real traction or quietly loses momentum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own &amp;amp; Build:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring together ES capabilities across CRM, commerce, CX, content, data, AI, platforms, media, measurement, marketing technology and managed services; assembling the right combination of expertise around a live opportunity rather than defaulting to a generic response&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain ownership of next actions and commercial momentum until the opportunity is ready for formal pursuit, activation, handoff or expansion, ensuring nothing stalls because no one was accountable for the next step&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify repeatable themes, playbook needs, case study requirements and market signals that help WPP Enterprise Solutions scale its growth motion, contributing to the system that makes the next opportunity easier to find, shape and win&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Who you are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a senior growth leader equally at home in a strategy conversation, a client meeting, a commercial negotiation and the execution that follows, because for you, these are not separate modes; they are the same job&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build trust quickly with senior stakeholders and navigate complex global matrix environments without losing pace or clarity, moving across lines of authority and geography as a natural part of how you work, not as an obstacle you manage around&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring genuine domain fluency in one or more of media, creative, consulting, platforms, marketing technology, CRM, commerce, data, AI, content or transformation, enough to be credible in client conversations, not simply directionally informed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can spot opportunity patterns before they become obvious, qualify what deserves your energy and resist the temptation to turn ambiguity into internal process noise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are high-agency, collaborative and commercially mature, able to move across teams, create momentum and make things happen without waiting for perfect structure or explicit permission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll need&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring typically 12 to 15 or more years of experience across enterprise growth, strategic account growth, consulting, technology transformation, digital transformation, media transformation, agency leadership, enterprise sales or client leadership, with a career that has consistently placed you at the point where commercial decisions are made, not downstream of them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have direct experience originating or shaping opportunities with measurable revenue potential, and you can point to them specifically, not just describe them in aggregate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand how enterprise clients buy transformation, technology, marketing, data, customer experience and managed services solutions, not as an academic proposition, but from having sat across the table from the people making those decisions and learned how they actually think&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your background may have been built inside WPP operating companies, major agency networks, consulting firms, systems integrators, digital transformation firms, technology companies, media networks or platform businesses. What matters is whether that background taught you how to find opportunity, qualify it honestly and move it forward in a complex, high-pressure commercial environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a proven ability to work across senior clients and internal stakeholders across multiple disciplines and markets, and a track record that reflects genuine accountability for commercial outcomes, not just meaningful involvement in them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence and world-class partnerships – all united by our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions). Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernization, connecting strategy directly to execution. Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses. VML, part of WPP, supports WPP Enterprise Solutions by helping brands activate transformation through creativity and experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;The Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Growth Group Director, you will be a senior hands-on growth operator whose value is measured in progress: moving live opportunities forward, giving early signals the structure and commercial credibility they need to become real ES pursuits, and keeping momentum alive when it would otherwise stall.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be client-facing, independently capable and expected to shape work. You will develop opportunity materials, run disciplined triage, accelerate live pursuits and connect client needs directly to ES capabilities. You will work with MDs, EDs, GCLs, agencies, client teams and ES capability leaders not as an internal resource to be directed, but as a skilled growth operator who can manage senior stakeholder interactions, build opportunity narratives and hold your own in the conversations that determine whether an opportunity moves or dies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is a strong fit for experienced operators who bring a blend of consulting, technology, agency, client services, strategic account, sales or transformation experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Core Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Find &amp;amp; Filter:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with senior growth leaders to identify ES growth signals across priority accounts, WPP relationships, client teams, market triggers and direct enterprise opportunities, bringing your own initiative and commercial instinct to the search rather than simply following direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess whether an opportunity has a clear client need, ES relevance, value potential, stakeholder access, urgency, winnability and a credible next action. You bring enough commercial judgement to give an honest, well-reasoned recommendation rather than a neutral summary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop opportunity briefs, problem statements, stakeholder maps, account views, discovery questions, value hypotheses and pursuit narratives, producing materials that are precise, client-ready and immediately usable by the senior leaders and client stakeholders who need them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Shape &amp;amp; Accelerate:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support discovery meetings, workshops, pitch preparation, proposal direction, client-ready points of view and immediate follow-up actions, keeping pursuits moving at the pace they require and ensuring nothing loses momentum in the gaps between conversations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply knowledge across one or more of media, creative, CRM, commerce, CX, content, data, AI, platforms, marketing technology, managed services or operating model transformation, with enough depth to add genuine value in client conversations rather than simply providing context&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with ES capability leaders, solution experts, commercial leads, partner teams and delivery SMEs to clarify the opportunity and define the required activation path, knowing who to bring in, when to bring them and how to brief them well&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clarify &amp;amp; Build:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn ambiguous inputs into clear, high-quality material that can support senior client and internal conversations. The standard is not that the material exists, but that it is good enough to use without revision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture patterns, proof points, cases and market themes that help the broader team move faster on similar opportunities, contributing to a growth system that gets sharper with everything you learn and produce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a clear, current view of opportunity value, stage, next action, conversion risk and required decision points, treating commercial discipline not as reporting overhead but as the operating standard of the role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Who you are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an experienced client-facing operator with the maturity to work directly with senior internal and client stakeholders. You are not the most junior person in the room seeking guidance; you are someone whose perspective and output are expected to move the conversation forward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable in ambiguity and able to structure problems and move work forward without waiting for full instruction. At this level, the brief is rarely complete, the path is rarely clear, and the value you add is precisely your ability to create order from that uncertainty&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are commercially minded and outcome-focused, with a genuine instinct for what has real revenue potential and what should be qualified out before it consumes energy it will not justify&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a strong writer and thinker who can translate complex transformation topics into sharp, usable opportunity materials. In this role, the quality of your thinking is visible in everything you produce, and the standard is whether a senior client or leader can pick it up and use it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are collaborative, practical and proactive, able to work across GCLs, agencies, consulting, technology, platform and ES capability teams without needing a formal authority structure to create momentum or a complete brief to begin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll need&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You typically bring 10 to 12 or more years of experience across strategic account management, growth, consulting, technology transformation, digital transformation, client services, business development, enterprise sales, media, creative, data, CRM, commerce or CX, with a track record that reflects genuine contribution to commercial outcomes rather than simply proximity to them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have direct experience supporting or leading client conversations, opportunity qualification, discovery, proposal development, pitch preparation or pursuit acceleration. You understand what separates a conversation that progresses from one that politely goes nowhere&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand how large organisations identify, fund and buy transformation, technology, marketing or customer experience work. This is not a theoretical framework for you; it is a practical reality you have navigated with real clients making real decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can move across complex internal organisations and connect multiple capabilities around one client opportunity, working through ambiguity of structure and authority without losing sight of the commercial objective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in a consulting firm, agency network, technology business, systems integrator, digital transformation firm, media network, WPP operating company or enterprise client environment gives you relevant and valuable context. What matters most is whether that background sharpened your ability to spot opportunity, qualify it honestly, produce high-quality materials and create the momentum that moves a pursuit forward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence and world-class partnerships – all united by our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions). Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernization, connecting strategy directly to execution. Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses. VML, part of WPP, supports WPP Enterprise Solutions by helping brands activate transformation through creativity and experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;The Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Growth Network Director, you will hold one of the most senior and consequential commercial roles within WPP Enterprise Solutions. You will be responsible for turning the most valuable market signals, client relationships, and WPP network intelligence into high-quality, strategically shaped growth opportunities and for creating the momentum that moves them from first conversation to qualified pursuit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operating at the intersection of consultative selling, transformation strategy, and executive relationship management, you will bring a rare combination of commercial instinct and intellectual rigour. You do not wait for a brief to arrive fully formed. You identify signals others miss, impose strategic clarity where ambiguity exists, shape the opportunity narrative before the client has fully articulated the need, and mobilise the right combination of WPP expertise around a live, credible commercial path. This is enterprise growth leadership in its most active and most demanding form.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working fluidly across WPP Network Growth, you will engage at the highest levels of the organisation and the market, operating credibly alongside Global Client Leads, agency CEOs, senior client stakeholders, consulting and technology partners, and ES capability heads. Your effectiveness will be measured not by the volume of relationships you manage, but by the quality of the opportunities you originate, the rigour with which you qualify and shape them, and your ability to connect the right people, at the right moment, around the right commercial proposition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Core Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Generate:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and progress high-value opportunities across existing WPP relationships, direct enterprise demand, senior stakeholder networks and strategic market signals, converting early intelligence into commercially viable pursuits before the opportunity has fully formed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build genuine, durable trust at the highest levels with Global Client Leads, agency leaders, WPP Media, WPP Creative, WPP Open, consulting and alliance partners, and senior client stakeholders, creating the access and relationships that sustain commercial momentum over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess each live opportunity with commercial discipline and strategic clarity, evaluating client need, ES relevance, revenue potential, urgency, stakeholder access, winnability and the required path to activation so that the team&#39;s energy is concentrated where it matters most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Shape:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate ambiguous client problems into a clear, compelling Enterprise Solutions opportunity narrative, spanning CRM, commerce, CX, content, data, AI, platforms, marketing technology, managed services and operating model transformation, making the complex feel navigable and the case for action feel urgent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the pursuit strategy for priority opportunities from end to end; owning problem framing, stakeholder mapping, commercial logic, solution direction, proof points and activation needs and carry that strategy through to a result&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know exactly when and how to bring in solution, commercial, technical, delivery, alliance and subject-matter expertise, assembling the right combination of people at the right point in the opportunity lifecycle, not before they add value and not after the moment has passed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Activate &amp;amp; Lead:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear, decisive leadership readouts on priority opportunities, covering blockers, decision points, commercial potential, next actions and escalation needs and ensuring senior stakeholders always have an accurate, current picture of where the most important pursuits stand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define how WPP Enterprise Solutions shows up to the network and to enterprise clients as a credible transformation and growth partner, contributing not just to individual opportunities but to the commercial infrastructure and positioning that makes future growth possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set a high bar for MD and Group Director colleagues across opportunity quality, client readiness, strategic thinking and commercial discipline, multiplying your impact well beyond your own pipeline and raising the performance of the team around you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Who you are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an executive-level growth leader with a demonstrated record of creating and converting large enterprise opportunities, not inheriting them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You operate with credibility in complex matrix environments, moving fluently across consulting, technology, agency, platform, media, creative and client leadership groups, adapting your register without losing your point of view&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are commercially sharp and consultative in equal measure, equally comfortable shaping a transformation strategy at the outset and driving the commercial execution that turns it into a win&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your executive presence is substantive, not performative. You can simplify complex transformation topics for senior client and internal audiences without losing the depth that makes your perspective worth having&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an entrepreneurial operator, capable of building a new growth motion from the ground up while advancing live opportunities that cannot wait for the infrastructure to be in place&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll need&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You typically bring 15 or more years of experience across enterprise growth, transformation consulting, technology consulting, digital transformation, marketing transformation, integrated agency leadership, strategic sales or complex client leadership, with a career that has consistently placed you in rooms where large, complex decisions were being made&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have worked directly with C-suite and senior enterprise stakeholders across marketing, technology, customer, operations, data, AI, commerce and transformation agendas and with enough regularity that it is your natural operating environment, not an occasional stretch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your background may have been built inside a consulting firm, systems integrator, technology business, digital transformation firm, large agency network, media network, WPP operating company or enterprise sales organisation. The path matters less than what it gave you: commercial depth, network credibility and the strategic range to operate at the level this role demands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have direct experience shaping large pursuits, managing strategic accounts, navigating multi-market opportunities, driving partner-led growth or leading multi-capability transformation programmes, and you understand the difference between being close to those efforts and being accountable for them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hold yourself and others to a high standard across revenue accountability, pipeline discipline, complex stakeholder management and opportunity qualification, not as processes you follow, but as disciplines that define how you work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence and world-class partnerships – all united by our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions). Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Couchbase, the operational data platform for AI, empowers businesses to succeed by bringing data to life in new ways. Major market-leading companies rely on Couchbase for mission critical operational, analytical, mobile and AI workloads. Built to replace legacy infrastructure and fragmented data services, Couchbase empowers enterprises with a unified platform architected for performance, flexibility and global scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With Couchbase, organizations bring their data to life, launching game‑changing customer experiences, exploring the limitless potential of AI, and seamlessly extending applications from the cloud to the edge and beyond. Couchbase’s AI‑ready technology and enterprise partnership model eliminate complexity and reduce total cost of ownership, enabling teams to stay agile, innovative and secure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Couchbase believes data should never slow you down, but act as the foundation for your next breakthrough. Discover why Couchbase is trusted to help the world’s biggest players scale, move fast and stay resilient, no matter what’s next on their roadmap. Visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://couchbase.com&quot;&gt;couchbase.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on LinkedIn and X.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Want to be part of our story? Apply today!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With your passion to learn about the cloud, you are excited to help build the Cloud Native management interfaces of an already Cloud Native Database platform. You will join a team of experienced engineers who are defining what it means to be a cloud native database platform, and you will contribute directly to the components and integrations that make it happen. With guidance from senior engineers, you will deepen your knowledge of the Cloud Native ecosystem, including Kubernetes, observability and automation tooling, and help bring Couchbase everywhere it can add value. You will have opportunities to contribute to Open Source Cloud Native projects and grow your presence in those communities. In doing so, you will help Couchbase continue to gather users, deployments and customers in the constantly growing database market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Management Features&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with senior engineers and product managers, design, implement, test and ship well-defined features that integrate Couchbase with Cloud Native tech such as Prometheus, Fluentd and Fluent-bit, and the Kubernetes Pod Autoscaler.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, maintainable, well-tested code; participate in code reviews, both giving and receiving feedback. Communicate progress, risks and dependencies clearly to your team and partner with Quality Engineering on test coverage for the features you build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support Across Lifecycle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to documentation, examples and tutorials on integration with Cloud Native ecosystem components such as Fluentd, Prometheus and OpenTelemetry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help Sales Engineers, Professional Services and Support investigate and resolve customer issues related to the features you own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the team’s development processes, including sprint planning, estimation, CI/CD and on-call or bug triage rotations, and suggest improvements where you see opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with Product and Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Product Managers, Architects and senior engineers to understand requirements and help refine the design of new features, sharing what you learn about the Cloud Native ecosystem along the way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineers on other teams where features depend on each other, and grow your knowledge of the broader Couchbase platform.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated, curious and self-driven individual, eager to learn new technologies quickly and grow with the guidance of senior team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with software development and build automation processes (Jenkins, GitHub Actions).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Golang or Python, and with Docker and Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with cloud deployment tooling (CloudFormation, Terraform, ARM Templates, GCP Cloud Deployment Manager).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with, or interest in, contributing to Open Source projects and working with a team distributed across time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MINIMUM QUALIFICATIONS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science or a related field, or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1+ years of professional software development experience, proficient in one or more programming languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for learning new technologies and a desire to automate the boring stuff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of containers and Kubernetes (professional, academic or personal projects)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Presence on GitHub (or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in Unix/Linux environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;At Couchbase, we believe innovation thrives when diverse perspectives are at the table. We actively encourage applications from individuals of all backgrounds—including women, people of color, LGTBQIA+ professionals, veterans, and individuals with disabilities. If you see a role that excites you, but don’t meet every qualification, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Studies show underrepresented talent is less likely to apply unless they meet all the criteria. We encourage you to apply if you’re excited about the role and can bring strong contributions to our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you require reasonable accommodations during the recruitment process, please let your recruiter know—we’re happy to support you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value diverse educational and career backgrounds. If your experience aligns with the role’s goals—even if it doesn’t follow a traditional path—we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Why Couchbase?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Modern customer experiences need a flexible cloud database platform that can power applications spanning from cloud to edge and everything in between. Couchbase’s mission is to simplify how developers and architects develop, deploy and consume modern applications wherever they are. We have reimagined the database with our fast, flexible and affordable cloud database platform Capella, allowing organizations to quickly build applications that deliver premium experiences to their customers– all with best-in-class price performance. More than 30% of the Fortune 100 trust Couchbase to power their modern applications and build innovative new ones. See our recent awards to learn why Couchbase is a great place to work.We are honored to be a part of the Best Places to Work Award for&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.couchbase.com/press-releases/couchbase-named-one-of-the-best-workplaces-in-the-bay-area-in-2022-by-great-place-to-work-and-fortune-magazine/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.couchbase.com/press-releases/couchbase-named-one-of-the-best-workplaces-in-the-bay-area-in-2022-by-great-place-to-work-and-fortune-magazine/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;the Bay Area&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.couchbase.com/press-releases/couchbase-awarded-uks-best-workplaces-recognition/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.couchbase.com/press-releases/couchbase-awarded-uks-best-workplaces-recognition/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;the UK&lt;/a&gt;. Couchbase offers a total rewards approach to benefits&amp;nbsp; that recognizes the value you create here, so that you in turn may best serve yourself and your family. Some benefits include:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Generous Time Off Program - Flexibility to care for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Wellness Benefits - A variety of world class medical plans to choose from, along with dental, vision, life insurance, and employee assistance programs*&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Financial Planning - Retirement program* and Business Travel Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Career Growth - Be valued, Create value approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Fun Perks - An ergonomic and comfortable in-office / WFH setup. Food &amp;amp; Snacks for in-office employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;And much more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;*Note: some programs are not applicable to all countries. Please discuss with a Couchbase recruiter to learn more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Learn more about Couchbase:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.couchbase.com/news-and-press-releases&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.couchbase.com/news-and-press-releases&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;News and Press Releases&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.couchbase.com/products/capella&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.couchbase.com/products/capella&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Couchbase Capella&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://blog.couchbase.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://blog.couchbase.com/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Couchbase Blog&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://investors.couchbase.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://investors.couchbase.com/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Investors&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disclaimer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Couchbase is committed to being an equal opportunity employer.&amp;nbsp; All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity, disability and protected veterans’ status, or any other characteristic protected by law. Join an impact initiative group and experience the amazing feeling of Couchbase can-do culture.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;By using this website and submitting your information, you acknowledge our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.couchbase.com/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; and understand your personal information may be processed in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.couchbase.com/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; following guidelines in your country of application.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weekly office requirement:&lt;/strong&gt; Monday/Wednesday weekly &lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment type:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seniority level: &lt;/strong&gt;Mid-senior&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At GWI we’re always looking for extraordinary people who thrive on making an extraordinary impact. Right now we’re looking for a&lt;strong&gt; Product Manager &lt;/strong&gt;to play a key role in our &lt;strong&gt;User Management (Revenue&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;amp; Enablement) &lt;/strong&gt;team in &lt;strong&gt;London&lt;/strong&gt;. If that’s you, and making a difference gets you out of bed in the morning, keep reading. It could be the start of something, well, extraordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Sounds great, what will I be doing? 🤔&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our Product Manager you&#39;ll own the systems that make GWI&#39;s subscription and consumption business run, such as billing, metering, user plans, feature access, product analytics and user messaging. It&#39;s the layer everything else sits on. Get it right and GWI can price, package and sell in new ways.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Two big pieces of work sit at the heart of this role. The first is billing for our consumption products, which is an area we&#39;re actively developing, and one you&#39;ll help shape. The second is making our internal tools talk to each other properly, so user data flows consistently between them and Salesforce, and everyone across the business is working from the same picture. Most of your stakeholders are internal - Revenue Operations, Finance, Business Intelligence, Client Success and Engineering - with some direct client contact along the way. You&#39;ll lead one squad of front-end and back-end engineers and a designer, alongside the PM and Engineers in our sister squad, Identity &amp;amp; Access - together you cover the whole of User Management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few things you’ll be responsible for:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;👉 Connecting our internal user management tools with Salesforce and each other, so data flows consistently and user information is mapped the same way everywhere
&lt;p&gt;👉 Billing for our consumption products - metering, API usage, payment flows and user plans&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 Customer feature flags, access and management - who can see what, and why&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 Product analytics - event firing, sign-up flow data, usage data - so the business can see what&#39;s happening and act on it&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 Building the roadmap from client feedback, internal stakeholder input and usage analytics, and prioritising the most valuable work&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 Scoping the work and owning how your squad delivers it&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;It’s also fun; shaking things up is what working for GWI is all about. You’ll need to be flexible, comfortable with continuous change, and working in a high-tempo environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What do I need to bring with me? 🧳&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll need to be able to demonstrate the core skills this role requires. You don&#39;t have to tick all the boxes right away; the important thing is that you’re willing to learn. Here’s what the team will be looking for in you:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 You&#39;ve shipped products at a B2B company&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 You&#39;ve built complex roadmaps with cross-functional dependencies, and you can balance multiple priorities without losing the plot&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 You make informed decisions at pace, even when the picture isn&#39;t complete&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 You&#39;re a strong problem solver, negotiator and influencer — you get alignment without needing authority&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 You explain complex things clearly to very different audiences: execs, engineers, customers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 You ask questions and draw knowledge out of your team to find the right engineering and design solutions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 You make informed decisions at pace, even when the picture isn&#39;t complete, and you&#39;re happy taking a big initiative and running with it&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 Bonus points if you&#39;ve worked with Salesforce before, or with tools that need to sync data between systems and internal user management systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Equally important is attitude. We want people who think big (to make an impact), ask why (to find a better way), and show respect (to everyone, at every level, all the time). Those are our values, and they’re a big part of what we’re looking for in you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 You&#39;ll work on how GWI packages its consumption products - commercial problems with real weight behind them&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 Your squad owns infrastructure the whole company depends on, so the work gets noticed&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 You&#39;ll build relationships across the business, from Finance to Engineering to the Exec team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👉 You&#39;ll learn from a senior PM who knows this space, with room to run your own squad your way&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Diversity, Equity &amp;amp; Inclusion 🫶&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity is fundamental to who we are—as a data company and as a workplace. Our data reflects global realities, and so must our teams. We strive to build a workforce as diverse and inclusive as the insights we deliver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Disability Confident employer, we welcome applications from disabled candidates and are committed to making adjustments throughout the hiring process—whether that&#39;s extra time, materials in advance or a different format, breaks, an adjusted interview format, assistive tools, or flexible scheduling. We&#39;re happy to discuss whatever would work best for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We actively encourage applications from underrepresented and marginalised communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At GWI, you&#39;ll find a place to contribute meaningfully, grow professionally, and belong fully.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/2g0akAyAlUU?si=dIgYyrKaAlNZK-NQ&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#li-hybrid&lt;br&gt;#LI-VS01&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot;&gt;Why Verifone&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more than 30 years Verifone has established a remarkable record of leadership in the electronic payment technology industry. Verifone has one of the leading electronic payment solutions brands and is one of the largest providers of electronic payment systems worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone has a diverse, dynamic and fast paced work environment in which employees are focused on results and have opportunities to excel. We take pride in the fact that we work with leading retailers, merchants, banks, and third party partners to invent and deliver innovative payments solution around the world. We strive for excellence in our products and services, and are obsessed with customer happiness. Across the globe, Verifone employees are leading the payments industry through experience, innovation, and an ambitious spirit. Whether it’s developing the next platform of secure payment systems or searching for new ways to bring electronic payments to new markets, the team at Verifone is dedicated to the success of our customers, partners and investors. It is this passion for innovation that drives each one of our employees for personal and professional success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone is proudly an in-office work culture as we see immense benefits to career development and business results from our colleagues being physically co-located.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot;&gt;What&#39;s Exciting About the Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;Product Manager - Hardware,&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;you will own the strategy, roadmap, and lifecycle of Verifone’s unattended and petroleum‑focused hardware platforms. This is a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;global role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;responsible for defining and evolving device portfolios used in kiosks, vending, transit, EV charging, fuel dispensers, and other unattended environments, with petroleum retail experience considered a strong advantage.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Vice President of Hardware Product Management, you will evaluate market opportunities, customer needs, regulatory requirements, and technology trends to guide product investments from concept through launch and long‑term lifecycle management. Working closely with engineering, industrial design, platform software, certification, operations, sales, and marketing teams, you will ensure Verifone delivers scalable, compliant, and competitive hardware solutions across global markets.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a hybrid role that will work out of our office in Alpharetta, GA or London, UK.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 3&quot;&gt;Product Strategy &amp;amp; Portfolio Ownership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Define and own the global product vision, strategy, and roadmap for unattended and Petro hardware platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Evaluate new business opportunities through market analysis, customer feedback, competitive assessment, and technology trends.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Optimize&amp;nbsp;the hardware portfolio by balancing innovation, cost, regional requirements, and long‑term platform sustainability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Drive decisions on product investments, enhancements, variants, and end‑of‑life planning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 3&quot;&gt;Market &amp;amp; Customer Insight&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Leverage deep understanding of the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;payments&amp;nbsp;ecosystem&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, unattended environments (kiosks, vending, transit, EV charging), and petroleum retail workflows to inform product direction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Engage directly with customers, partners, and regional teams to&amp;nbsp;validate&amp;nbsp;requirements and prioritize features.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Monitor global regulatory, certification, and compliance needs (e.g., payments, security, accessibility) that impact hardware design and deployment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 3&quot;&gt;Cross‑Functional Execution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work closely with hardware, firmware, and platform engineering teams to translate market needs into clear product requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Validate early product definitions, concepts, and prototypes with customers and internal stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Partner with Product Marketing to support positioning, launch readiness, and enablement activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Collaborate with operations, supply chain, and quality teams to ensure successful product delivery at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 3&quot;&gt;Lifecycle &amp;amp; Delivery Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own product definition from concept through development, launch, and ongoing evolution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ensure product plans align with customer timelines, certification constraints, and global rollout needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Support internal teams by acting as the primary product authority for unattended and Petro hardware platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot;&gt;Required Experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Engineering, Computer Science, Electronics, or&amp;nbsp;a related&amp;nbsp;technical field (or equivalent experience).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong experience in&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;product management for hardware or hardware‑enabled platforms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Demonstrated knowledge of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;payments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, payment devices, or transaction‑driven environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience working with cross‑functional teams across multiple geographies and time zones.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ability to read, understand, and contribute to technical documentation and specifications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills in English.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role requires approximately 20% travel, including visits to customer sites, regional team engagements, and industry events across global markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot;&gt;Preferred Experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience with&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;unattended payment environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;(e.g., kiosks, vending, transit, EV charging).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Petroleum retail or fuel dispenser experience is a strong plus, but not required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Familiarity with hardware and software development lifecycles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Exposure to Agile development practices and tools (e.g., Jira, Confluence).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Knowledge of fintech, embedded systems, or secure payment technologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot;&gt;Key Competencies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strategic Thinking:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ability to align product decisions with long‑term business and platform strategy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Customer‑Centric Mindset:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong focus on solving real customer problems in complex environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Analytical Skills:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Comfortable evaluating market data, customer input, and tradeoffs to drive decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Effective at influencing and leading without direct authority.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Execution Focus:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Able to balance strategic vision with practical delivery realities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot;&gt;Our Commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone is committed to creating a diverse environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status. Verifone is also committed to compliance with all fair employment practices regarding citizenship and immigration status.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Liftoff&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; is a leading AI-powered performance marketing platform for the mobile app economy. Our end-to-end technology stack helps app marketers acquire and retain high-value users, while enabling publishers to maximize revenue across programmatic and direct demand.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Liftoff’s solutions, including Accelerate, Direct, Monetize, Intelligence, and Vungle Exchange, support over 6,600 mobile businesses across 74 countries in sectors such as gaming, social, finance, ecommerce, and entertainment. Founded in 2012 and headquartered in Redwood City, CA, Liftoff has a diverse, global presence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this team:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Liftoff, the View Master team plays a crucial role in the company&#39;s success. Our team builds mobile SDKs (iOS, Android, Windows), and systems that connect Liftoff’s publishers with advertisers, managing applications, campaigns, and creatives that feed into our ad serving pipeline. We create innovative advertisements viewed by millions daily, ensuring a seamless user experience and optimizing ad performance.&amp;nbsp; We&#39;re a group of innovative engineers who leverage the latest technology to develop efficient and scalable systems. If you&#39;re passionate about building and scaling low-latency, high-throughput systems, we&#39;d be delighted to speak with you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical direction for new ad format development in the SDK, driving decisions on native/web architecture and cross-platform compatibility without needing detailed direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently scope and lead ambiguous, cross-team initiatives from problem definition through rollout — e.g., overhauling automation quality and creative/SDK interoperability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive multi-quarter improvements to system efficiency, reliability, and rendering performance, owning tradeoffs between short- and long-term solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and evangelize testing strategy and standards (unit, integration, automated) across the team, not just execute against existing practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and drive experimentation and canary-release strategy for ad unit performance, including recommending which approaches to pursue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technically lead and mentor other engineers on the team, including guiding junior/mid-level engineers&#39; project work and growth (not just informal mentorship)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the team in cross-functional and roadmap discussions, influencing prioritization and scope rather than only attending for alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uphold and help define the team&#39;s engineering bar for code quality, security/privacy, cost efficiency, and production hygiene (oncall, monitoring, documentation)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to hiring and leveling: participate in interviews, help hold the technical bar for the role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science or related fields and 6 years of relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in JavaScript (ES6+), CSS preprocessors, and HTML5, with demonstrated ability to make architectural decisions in this stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in and helping shape Agile processes for a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills, including the ability to influence technical direction across engineering and product without formal authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous AdTech experience is highly valued&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing mobile applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced automated testing strategies using tools such as AWS Device Farm, iOS and Android simulators, Playwright, Selenium, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;This role is eligible for remote or hybrid work out of our London office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Expectations:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;We offer several opportunities for in-person team gatherings, including but not limited to project meetings, regional meet-ups, and company-wide events. We expect our employees to attend these gatherings at least once per quarter. These gatherings provide essential opportunities for collaboration, communication, and team building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Liftoff offers all employees a full compensation package that includes equity and health/vision/dental benefits associated with your country of residence. Base compensation will vary based on the candidate&#39;s location and experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-NM1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Liftoff offers a fast-paced, collaborative, and innovative work environment where employees are empowered to grow and make an impact. We’re shaping the future of the mobile app ecosystem—join us and help accelerate what’s next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Liftoff’s compensation strategy includes competitive salaries, equity, and benefits designed to support employee well-being and performance. We benchmark compensation based on role, level, and location to ensure fairness and market alignment. Benefits may include medical coverage, wellness stipends, and additional perks based on your country of residence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Liftoff is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees and applicants regardless of race, ethnicity, national origin, age, marital status, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, religion, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agency and Third Party Recruiter Notice:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Liftoff does not accept unsolicited resumes from individual recruiters or third-party recruiting agencies in response to job postings. No fee will be paid to third parties who submit unsolicited candidates directly to our hiring managers or Recruiting Team. All candidates must be submitted via our Applicant Tracking System by approved Liftoff vendors who have been expressly requested to make a submission by our Recruiting Team for a specific job opening. No placement fees will be paid to any firm unless such a request has been made by the Liftoff Recruiting Team and such a candidate was submitted to the Liftoff Recruiting Team via our Applicant Tracking System.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Liftoff&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; is a leading AI-powered performance marketing platform for the mobile app economy. Our end-to-end technology stack helps app marketers acquire and retain high-value users, while enabling publishers to maximize revenue across programmatic and direct demand.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Liftoff’s solutions, including Accelerate, Direct, Monetize, Intelligence, and Vungle Exchange, support over 6,600 mobile businesses across 74 countries in sectors such as gaming, social, finance, ecommerce, and entertainment. Founded in 2012 and headquartered in Redwood City, CA, Liftoff has a diverse, global presence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Account Manager, you&#39;ll be a senior individual contributor and a cornerstone of our commercial team. You&#39;ll own an above-average revenue target and be expected to consistently deliver, and exceed, it. Operating with a high degree of autonomy; you&#39;ll manage complex, high-value deals end-to-end, drive forecast accuracy, and actively shape how we go to market. This role sits at the intersection of sales execution, cross-functional collaboration, and strategic influence: you&#39;ll be as comfortable building a Looker report as you are leading a high-stakes negotiation, and as effective with Finance and Product as you are in front of a customer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and grow a portfolio of key accounts, consistently exceeding revenue targets and carrying above-average quota.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate pipeline and revenue forecasts, surfacing risks proactively and identifying in-quarter opportunities to accelerate attainment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex, high-value negotiations; adapting style to different stakeholders and closing with minimal concessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and tailor compelling value propositions, running multi-channel outreach to fill and advance pipeline efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple concurrent work-streams with clear ownership, balancing scope, time, and quality with minimal oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Product, Marketing, Finance, and Operations to deliver solutions and influence roadmap priorities based on customer feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse multi-dimensional data in Looker, AI and Google Sheets to surface actionable insights and build compelling, decision-driving narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach junior team members and contribute to a culture of proactive, well-received feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of exceeding revenue targets in digital advertising, account management, or consultative sales; preferably within mobile or programmatic ad-tech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong forecasting discipline and pipeline management skills, with experience running high-value deals from prospecting through close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled negotiator who adapts approach intuitively and is comfortable managing complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Looker, AI and Google Sheets, with the ability to analyse complex data sets and build clear, impactful visualisations independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent cross-functional collaborator, with experience engaging Product, Finance, and Marketing beyond immediate deal needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High emotional intelligence, strong communication skills, and the ability to give and receive feedback constructively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree; advanced degree a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel up to 10% for client meetings and industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Expectations:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer several opportunities for in-person team gatherings, including but not limited to project meetings, regional meetups, and company-wide events. We expect our employees to attend these gatherings at least once per quarter. These gatherings provide essential opportunities for collaboration, communication, and team building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Liftoff offers all employees a full compensation package that includes equity and health/vision/dental benefits associated with your country of residence. Base compensation will vary based on the candidate&#39;s location and experience.&lt;/p&gt;
