&lt;h5 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://dol.ny.gov/system/files/documents/2022/02/ls740_1.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;New York applicants: Notice of Employee Rights&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
