&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission Brief&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help build the digital manufacturing backbone we need to scale production and get rockets into the air. You will turn fragmented processes into practical, scalable solutions that make a visible difference on the shopfloor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your Role in Our Space Mission:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with manufacturing teams to understand challenges and define clear, scalable target processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate manufacturing needs into intuitive Tulip applications, digital workflows and reliable data structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, test and release solutions that operators and engineers can rely on in daily production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own solutions from initial discovery through training, documentation, support and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify process improvements, new use cases and opportunities to create greater manufacturing impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep the bigger system landscape in view and collaborate with Global IT on integrations with SAP, Teamcenter, machines and other systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualification Checklist&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in manufacturing, process engineering, MES or production digitalization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building operational applications; Tulip experience is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to turn complex or fragmented processes into clear, scalable digital solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of manufacturing data flows and connected system landscapes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ownership, attention to detail and curiosity to challenge existing approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and professional proficiency in English; German is beneficial.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Aim high, deliver relentlessly, act with integrity, and keep the mission first.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
