&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you believe you’ve been targeted by a scam or have any doubts regarding the authenticity of any job listing purportedly from or on behalf of AlphaSense please contact us. Your security and trust matter to us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlphaSense:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The world’s most sophisticated companies rely on AlphaSense to remove uncertainty from decision-making. With market intelligence and search built on proven AI, AlphaSense delivers insights that matter from content you can trust. Our universe of public and private content includes equity research, company filings, event transcripts, expert calls, news, trade journals, and clients’ own research content. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The acquisition of Tegus by AlphaSense in 2024 advances our shared mission to empower professionals to make smarter decisions through AI-driven market intelligence. Together, AlphaSense and Tegus will accelerate growth, innovation, and content expansion, with complementary product and content capabilities that enable users to unearth even more comprehensive insights from thousands of content sets. Our platform is trusted by over 6,000 enterprise customers, including a majority of the S&amp;amp;P 500. Founded in 2011, AlphaSense is headquartered in New York City with more than 2,000 employees across the globe and offices in the U.S., U.K., Finland, India, Singapore, Canada, and Ireland. Come join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Expert Insights:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Expert Insights, which spans AlphaSense’s Expert Transcript Library and 1x1 Call Services offerings,&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;delivers a new and transformative form of market intelligence content. Through transcripts covering thousands of companies, it captures the unfiltered views and insights of business operators in the trenches, interviewed by professional investors who drill into key questions on what’s truly important about a company at each moment in time. AlphaSense’s library of over 220,000 transcripts is the market’s largest, covering all sectors of the economy, with thousands more published each month. Expert Insights is quickly becoming a table-stakes solution for institutional investors to choose the right companies to invest in while gaining rapid adoption among all other consumers of market intelligence from sell-side research and banking, consultancies, and large corporations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Directed Content Team is an integral part of the Expert Insights group, generating thousands of calls each quarter on high-value and strategic content targets - ensuring that the AlphaSense Expert Transcript Library (ETL) delivers comprehensive coverage to our users. The Directed Content team is responsible for identifying, recruiting, and onboarding the best possible experts from around the world based on the targets and topics we are looking to generate content against - ensuring that the interviews with those experts are of the highest-possible quality and relevance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Sector Lead on our TMT (Technology, Media and Telecoms) Directed Content team, you will play a pivotal role in ensuring AlphaSense delivers the highest-quality proprietary research content within your assigned sector. Reporting to the Director of Research (TMT) you will oversee the day-to-day execution of Directed Content projects, ensuring all work meets the firm’s standards for quality, relevance, and, end-user value delivery. As Sector Lead, you will manage coverage of EMEA and APAC companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will combine operational rigor with sector expertise to oversee a team of Project Managers responsible for generating expert call transcripts across a diverse range of topics within your coverage universe. Your responsibilities will span project setup, expert sourcing guidance, transcript quality assurance, budget oversight, and performance management. Acting as the connective layer between the Director of Research’s strategic vision and day-to-day execution, you will ensure flawless delivery of sector coverage plans while maintaining a pulse on emerging market themes and client information needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also serve as a key stakeholder in developing and optimizing project workflows, implementing structured QA and feedback loops, and partnering with Product and Operations teams to pilot new AI-enabled tools that elevate both efficiency and insight quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;the Director of Research to develop and maintain a strategic sector roadmap, which you will then translate into a structured execution plan, ensuring coverage aligns with key market and client priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and mentor a team of Project Managers that oversee the execution of Directed Content projects, setting clear goals, tracking KPIs, and ensuring accountability across all deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Operations Managers who oversee Analyst execution of expert recruiting, onboarding, and interaction facilitation to align operational KPIs to coverage strategy and optimize execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own expert budget management for your sector, allocating resources effectively to maximize content ROI while maintaining high quality and throughput.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee a structured QA process for ensuring transcripts within your sector of coverage meet the highest standards for data accuracy, relevance, structure, and analytical depth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with the Director of Research and our Content Strategy Analyst to monitor engagement data, identify coverage gaps, and recalibrate project pipelines accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with the Director of Research to identify and shape content to support revenue-generating efforts such as white papers, webinars, internal and external presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain feedback loops with call takers and project teams to enhance the quality and insight of future content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with North America directed content teams to ensure high quality output and consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Operations and Product teams to pilot and optimize AI-enabled tools that improve project throughput, QA precision, and overall efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain deep familiarity with ongoing developments within the Healthcare, TMT or Energy &amp;amp; Industrial sectors, proactively surfacing new themes and companies to guide future research focus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 5–7 years of experience in equity research, market intelligence, consulting, or a related analytical role within TMT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring deep domain expertise in Technology, Media &amp;amp; Telecoms with a strong grasp of the key players, business models, and industry trends shaping your space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong understanding of European and Asian equity markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have proven people management experience, successfully leading, mentoring, and developing teams of project managers or analysts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are skilled at translating strategic objectives into actionable research projects that yield high-impact insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess exceptional organizational, analytical, and critical-thinking skills, able to balance multiple priorities with agility while maintaining high quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong command of project economics, capable of managing budgets, optimizing expert costs, and tracking ROI to ensure resource efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are adept at working cross-functionally with Directors of Research, Go-to-Market, Product, and Compliance to ensure alignment and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are intellectually curious, client-oriented, and comfortable operating in a fast-paced, dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You maintain a strong understanding of compliance, MNPI, and confidentiality standards across all project types.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is an equal-opportunity employer. We are committed to a work environment that supports, inspires, and respects all individuals. All employees share in the responsibility for fulfilling AlphaSense’s commitment to equal employment opportunity. AlphaSense does not discriminate against any employee or applicant on the basis of race, color, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, age, religion, marital status, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, military or veteran status, disability, or any other non-merit factor. This policy applies to every aspect of employment at AlphaSense, including recruitment, hiring, training, advancement, and termination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In addition, it is the policy of AlphaSense to provide reasonable accommodation to qualified employees who have protected disabilities to the extent required by applicable laws, regulations, and ordinances where a particular employee works.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Recruiting Scams and Fraud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We at AlphaSense have been made aware of fraudulent job postings and individuals impersonating AlphaSense recruiters. These scams may involve fake job offers, requests for sensitive personal information, or demands for payment. Please note:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense never asks candidates to pay for job applications, equipment, or training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;All official communications will come from an @&lt;a href=&quot;http://alpha-sense.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://alpha-sense.com/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2sfhQUZloRzVpQ4Yj1Ftlo&quot;&gt;alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you’re unsure about a job posting or recruiter, verify it on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3I0CFwb1ser7ImCRD48YOl&quot;&gt;Careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you believe you’ve been targeted by a scam or have any doubts regarding the authenticity of any job listing purportedly from or on behalf of AlphaSense please contact us. Your security and trust matter to us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you for considering Tailscale. If this job description resonates with you, please apply.&amp;nbsp;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Frequently cited statistics show that people who identify with historically marginalized groups are likely to apply to jobs only if they meet 100% of the qualifications. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We encourage you to help us break that statistic!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Tailscale&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tailscale is making safe connection effortless by delivering software that makes it easy to securely interconnect people and their devices, no matter where they are. From hobbyists to multinational corporations, teams of every size use Tailscale each day to protect their networks, share access to internal tools, and more. We&#39;re building a future for the Internet that&#39;s easy, sensible, and safe, like it used to be. Founded in 2019 and fully distributed, we&#39;re backed by Accel, CRV, Insight, Heavybit, and Uncork Capital.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re passionate about solving complex technical problems and helping build trust between customers and engineering, this is the role for you. We&#39;re seeking a motivated Customer Reliability Engineer to join our team. You&#39;ll take ownership of our most complex, ambiguous customer escalations, solving issues where the root cause is not always obvious. You will work these issues to resolution or alternatively a fully-documented handoff that engineering can act on without delay.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Customer Reliability Engineer, you&#39;ll partner closely with the Customer Success Team, Support Team, and Product/Engineering to close the gap between &quot;customer has described a problem&quot; and &quot;engineering has what it needs to fix it.&quot; This role reports directly to the Customer Reliability Engineer Team Lead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own high-severity, post-sales technical escalations from intake through resolution or engineering handoff. This includes deep-dive investigations and reproduction of difficult-to-isolate bugs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get on calls with customers, pull logs, and communicate with the customer about leading theories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build engineering handoff packages that require minimal follow-up questions: reproducible case, log evidence (timestamps, node IDs), version matrix, impact scope, what&#39;s already been ruled out, and a proposed engineering team to own the fix.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;File and track issues for confirmed bugs, keeping the ticket/issue link intact so engineering retains full customer context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor for patterns across escalations to catch recurring or systemic issues early; translate what you learn into product improvements, tooling, and runbooks that raise the technical bar for the whole Support org.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Support, CSE, and Product/Eng, while staying within this team&#39;s scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years in a technical support or escalation role at a SaaS or infrastructure company, with demonstrated ownership of escalated/enterprise-tier accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine problem-solver who gets energy from untangling hard, ambiguous technical issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable owning a live, high-stakes customer call: staying calm, building trust, and communicating clearly with a frustrated or technical customer under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on networking experience in production or homelab environments: TCP/IP, routing, DNS, firewalls, NAT, VPNs, load balancers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with overlay networking concepts — WireGuard, UDP hole punching, STUN — and comparable VPN/networking products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Code-level debugging capability: can read Go source, reason about goroutines/locks/channels, read pprof CPU/heap profiles, and understand network interface semantics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with infrastructure concepts: cloud IaaS, CI/CD pipelines, containerized applications, and Kubernetes debugging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong systems administration skills as well as troubleshooting across Linux, macOS, and Windows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of independently building reproducible test cases and clear, evidence-backed bug reports engineering can act on directly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical storytelling: able to distill highly technical, ambiguous issues into clear narratives for both engineers and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigative mindset; curious to analyze root cause, and evaluate all options to get customers to the best solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with programming/scripting in Go, Python, JSON&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with packet-level analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a company, we strive to maintain fair and equitable compensation practices within our team across all roles and all levels. Tailscale&#39;s compensation package includes base salary, equity, and comprehensive benefits. The salary range displayed on each job posting represents the target range for a new hire&#39;s base salary. Individual offers may vary based on experience and skill set.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;UK Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£90,850&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£113,760 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An inclusive, flexible environment where you can be your authentic self.&lt;/strong&gt; We recognize the impact of diverse voices and backgrounds on the growth of our people, product, and company. And that flexibility in how and when you work empowers our team to integrate work and life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A competitive total compensation package.&lt;/strong&gt; This includes a base salary, an equity incentive plan and variable commission (for quota-based roles).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comprehensive group benefits with no waiting period. &lt;/strong&gt;Take advantage of coverage for health, vision, dental, and more for you and your family!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote first company&lt;/strong&gt;—most of our teams work fully remotely. Enjoy a change of scenery wherever you can get wifi, participate in virtual and in-person social events, and leverage our corporate co-working program to visit WeWork (or other similar spaces near you). Some roles require in-office collaboration depending on team needs, which will be clearly noted in the job description.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employer-funded retirement contributions. &lt;/strong&gt;Tailscale will match your retirement contributions dollar-for-dollar, up to a maximum annual employer contribution equal to 0.75% of your eligible compensation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect with other Tailscalars IRL. &lt;/strong&gt;Attend our annual company retreat, participate in team off-sites, and collaborate in person with teammates across Canada, the United States, the United Kingdom, and Singapore. We support intentional in-person connection through team travel and distributed collaboration.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support for your personal and professional development.&lt;/strong&gt; Grow your career thoughtfully with $1500 USD annually for professional development, or take advantage of mentorship, coaching, and internal promotion opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid time off and a healthy work-life integration.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Our flexible, paid time off program supports you for any situation life throws your way, whether moving homes or travelling the world!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A build-your-own home office setup. &lt;/strong&gt;You choose your own company-owned laptop (Mac or PC), receive a monthly home internet reimbursement, and $500 USD to customize your workstation to make it your own.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid parental leave program&lt;/strong&gt;. We care about your life outside of work and encourage new parents to take advantage of parental leave top-ups (20 weeks for birthing parents, 16 weeks for non-birthing parents).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tailscale is committed to providing an accessible and inclusive hiring process. If you require an accommodation at any stage of the recruitment process or related to any aspect of this role, please contact your recruiter.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our hiring process uses AI-assisted tools to help screen and assess candidates. All hiring decisions are made by people.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please be aware that legitimate emails from Tailscale&#39;s talent team will only originate from ----- ----- and ----- email addresses. For more information about protecting yourself from impersonators and scams, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://tailscale.com/scam-awareness&quot;&gt;https://tailscale.com/scam-awareness&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Pantheon has been at the forefront of private markets investing for more than 40 years, earning a reputation for an innovative approach to investing in secondaries, co-investments, and primary fund investments, as well as capital formation across commingled funds, evergreen vehicles and customized solutions. Our specialist investment capabilities span multiple strategies across private equity, infrastructure and real assets, and private credit. Through our collaborative and committed culture, we find new ways to solve complex problems together and deliver innovative investment opportunities across private markets. Pantheon currently manages approximately $82.3 billion in AUM across all its strategies, serving more than 750 institutional and 638 private wealth clients worldwide&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For further details please visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.pantheon.com&quot;&gt;www.pantheon.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose of Position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Enterprise Risk Manager will support the Enterprise Risk function on a fixed-term basis to support the delivery of key regulatory and risk management initiatives. The role will focus on supporting compliance with regulatory requirements relating to PIN and PINT (Provision 34), advancing the firm&#39;s Internal Controls System (ICS) framework, and further enhancing operational risk management capabilities across the business.&lt;br&gt;The position will report directly to the Head of Enterprise Risk and will work closely with senior stakeholders across all business functions to strengthen risk governance, controls documentation, and regulatory readiness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Internal Controls System (ICS) Framework&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the enhancement, and implementation of the firm&#39;s Internal Controls System (ICS) framework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with business owners to identify, document, and assess key processes, risks, and controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the centralisation of risk and control documentation to meet evolving regulatory expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure risk and control inventories are complete, accurate, and maintained within the firm&#39;s designated governance platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge and validate control design and effectiveness to support a robust control environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Regulatory Programme Delivery&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the delivery of regulatory commitments relating to PIN and PINT, including requirements under Provision 34.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with first and second line stakeholders to gather, review, and evidence regulatory deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in preparing materials, documentation, and management reporting for regulatory reviews and internal governance forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track progress against regulatory milestones and identify risks, issues, and dependencies impacting delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enterprise and Operational Risk Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the continued enhancement of the enterprise and operational risk management frameworks (such as Fraud and Operational Resilience frameworks).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify control gaps, emerging risks, and opportunities for framework improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support incident, issue, and remediation management activities where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and management of data privacy related framework enhancements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stakeholder Engagement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong working relationships with business leaders and risk owners across the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide guidance and challenge on risk and controls best practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate workshops and working sessions to support process mapping, risk assessment, and controls documentation activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver clear and concise reporting to senior management and governance committees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge and Experience Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience within Enterprise Risk, Operational Risk, Internal Controls, or Risk Transformation within financial services (incl. operational resilience, outsourcing, or third-party risk frameworks).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting risk framework enhancement, or governance programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of risk and control frameworks, including Risk and Control Self-Assessments (RCSAs), process mapping, and controls documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing or enhancing Internal Controls System (ICS) frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of financial services regulatory expectations and governance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience partnering with senior business stakeholders and control owners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical, documentation, and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently, manage multiple workstreams, and operate effectively in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within asset management, private markets, banking, or investment management environments would be advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting regulatory engagements or remediation programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of governance, risk, and compliance (GRC) systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing centralised risk and controls libraries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This job description is not to be construed as an exhaustive statement of duties, responsibilities, or requirements. You may be required to perform other job-related duties as reasonably requested by your manager.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pantheon is an Equal Opportunities employer, we are committed to building a diverse and inclusive workforce so if you&#39;re excited about this role but your past experience doesn&#39;t perfectly align we&#39;d still encourage you to apply.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Sales team at SevenRooms is on a mission to reshape the hospitality industry by empowering operators to take control of their guest relationships. We’re a passionate, high-performing group of go-getters who act as trusted advisors to restaurants and hospitality groups around the world. We take a consultative approach to sales—identifying business gaps, crafting thoughtful solutions, and helping operators reduce reliance on third-party networks. We believe in the power of hospitality, and we’re proud to partner with businesses to streamline operations and deliver magical guest experiences every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Executive, you’ll work directly with restaurants and hospitality groups to understand their business needs and recommend the best-fit SevenRooms solutions—from reservations and table management to online ordering and marketing automation. You’ll drive new business by adding operators to the platform and working closely with our onboarding and account teams to ensure a smooth and enthusiastic transition. This role plays a key part in helping hospitality operators thrive, combining strategic thinking, relationship-building, and product knowledge to deliver real impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and Manage a Sales Pipeline&lt;/strong&gt;. Identify and engage prospective restaurants and hospitality groups to grow your book of business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Showcase the Platform.&lt;/strong&gt; Present the value of SevenRooms through compelling demos and conversations that help operators understand how we can support their success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Sales from Start to Finish.&lt;/strong&gt; Own the full sales cycle—from prospecting and pitching to negotiation, contracting, and go-live support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver Live Product Demos.&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct live, engaging product walkthroughs both virtually and in person when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a Trusted Partner.&lt;/strong&gt; Build strong relationships with prospects and clients, always advocating for their success and acting as a true advisor throughout the process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re excited about you because…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 3+ years of experience in hospitality technology sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re confident presenting to clients both in person and virtually&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re self-driven and comfortable working independently, whether in the office or remotely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re tech-savvy and quick to pick up new tools and platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re results-oriented and bring energy and focus to your daily work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve worked with tools like Salesforce, Outreach, or similar systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a background in hospitality or restaurants (a big plus!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re open to occasional travel into key markets to connect with clients face-to-face&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You speak fluent German and English&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;Notice to Applicants for Jobs Located in NYC or Remote Jobs Associated With Office in NYC Only&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use Covey as part of our hiring and/or promotional process for jobs in NYC and certain features may qualify it as an AEDT in NYC. As part of the hiring and/or promotion process, we provide Covey with job requirements and candidate submitted applications. We began using &lt;a href=&quot;https://getcovey.com/product/covey-scout-inbound&quot;&gt;Covey Scout for Inbound&lt;/a&gt; from August 21, 2023, through December 21, 2023, and resumed using &lt;a href=&quot;https://getcovey.com/product/covey-scout-inbound&quot;&gt;Covey Scout for Inbound&lt;/a&gt; again on June 29, 2024.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Covey tool has been reviewed by an independent auditor. Results of the audit may be viewed here: &lt;a style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot; href=&quot;https://getcovey.com/nyc-local-law-144&quot;&gt;Covey&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SevenRooms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2011, Joel Montaniel, Allison Page, and Kinesh Patel founded SevenRooms after noticing that hospitality operators were missing a critical ingredient in the systems they were using to run their business: guest data. What began as a mission to help restaurants better understand and serve their guests evolved into a powerful platform used by merchants around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With best-in-class tools for marketing, operations, and guest experience — all deeply integrated with its industry-leading CRM — SevenRooms empowers operators to drive revenue, streamline operations, and deliver experiences that keep guests coming back.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2025, DoorDash acquired SevenRooms to strengthen its in-store strategy and expand its merchant-first offerings. The combination brings together DoorDash’s scale, reach, and digital innovation with SevenRooms’ in-store capabilities to support hospitality businesses across every channel — from discovery and delivery to on-premise dining.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As DoorDash builds out its in-store capabilities, SevenRooms plays a central role in enabling merchants to grow their businesses and connect more meaningfully with guests, whether they’re ordering online or dining in. This move reflects DoorDash’s broader commitment to empowering local businesses, fostering stronger connections between consumers and the places they love, and building technology that meets merchants — and their customers — wherever they are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about our legitimate recruiting process at &lt;span class=&quot;_80om1qgj _1e0c1nu9&quot; data-testid=&quot;smart-link-draggable-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;loader-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_1yt4x7n9 _2rko1ssi _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz13af _1rkwglyw _4cvx1w55 _19itia51 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b18uv _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehiw5lj _1j5pglyw _1di615s3&quot; href=&quot;https://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-resolved-view&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-icon-and-title&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw&quot;&gt;Recruitment Scam Awareness - DoorDash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Shape the test strategy that proves Graphcore firmware is ready for production hardware.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff System Software Engineer, you will lead firmware QA across Graphcore’s next-generation hardware platforms. You will verify the low level software behind boot, configuration and monitoring.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your tests will protect production firmware quality, from power sequencing to hardware interfaces and telemetry. You will create reliable gates for firmware used across teams and systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will design test infrastructure, build high coverage tests and debug issues with hardware and analysers. You will also guide best practice while staying close to the code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role needs technical breadth, embedded systems depth and calm ownership of difficult problems. You will shape how firmware quality scales at Graphcore.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The team and culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join the Firmware QA team within System Software QA. The team validates low level software for complete boot, configuration and monitoring of Graphcore silicon and hardware platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work happens close to hardware, across firmware, software and platform teams. You will turn requirements and use cases into acceptance tests that protect production quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decisions are shaped by evidence, technical discussion and clear ownership. You will speak up, set standards and mentor engineers through practical, hands-on leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Significant experience in firmware qualification across complex embedded systems.&lt;br&gt;· Deep understanding of real time embedded systems and complex boot logic.&lt;br&gt;· Experience working with hardware, debuggers and analysers.&lt;br&gt;· Strong understanding of silicon and hardware interfaces, including I2C, I3C, SMBus, SPI, PCIe, DDR and power management.&lt;br&gt;· Experience with CI/CD, build tools and modern testing practices.&lt;br&gt;· Ability to debug cross-layer issues, drive root-cause investigations and communicate complex technical concepts clearly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we have outlined a set of requirements, we value transferable skills and diverse experiences. If you meet most of our essential criteria, we encourage you to submit an application and showcase how your background makes you a strong candidate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Flexible working: Balance your work and personal life with greater flexibility&lt;br&gt;· Generous leave: Take time to rest, recharge and enjoy life outside of work&lt;br&gt;· Retirement planning support: Up to 5% matched pension&lt;br&gt;· Phantom equity: Share in Graphcore’s success&lt;br&gt;· Workplace experience: Enjoy thoughtfully designed office spaces for collaboration, with free food and an on-site barista to support your day&lt;br&gt;· Peace of mind protection: Income protection and life assurance to provide financial security for you and your loved ones&lt;br&gt;· Flexible benefits: Tailor your benefits package with a choice of additional options, including private medical insurance and dental cover&lt;br&gt;· Optional benefits: Dental cover, health cash plan, private medical insurance, cycle to work scheme, give as you earn&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome people from all backgrounds and experiences and are committed to building an inclusive environment where everyone can do their best work.&lt;br&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer and recognise that everyone brings different strengths and perspectives. If you need any adjustments during the interview process, just let us know - we’re happy to support you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sponsorship&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must have the legal right to work in the UK. Unfortunately, we are unable to provide visa sponsorship or support visa applications for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the Team at Graphcore&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Graphcore is one of the world’s leading innovators in Artificial Intelligence compute. It is developing hardware, software and systems infrastructure that will unlock the next generation of AI breakthroughs and power the widespread adoption of AI solutions across every industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the SoftBank Group, Graphcore is a member of an elite family of companies responsible for some of the world’s most transformative technologies. Together, they share a bold vision: to enable Artificial Super Intelligence and ensure its benefits are accessible to everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Graphcore’s teams are drawn from diverse backgrounds and bring a broad range of skills and perspectives. A melting pot of AI research specialists, silicon designers, software engineers and systems architects, Graphcore brings together deep expertise to solve complex problems and deliver meaningful progress in AI compute.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to shape firmware quality for Graphcore’s next-generation hardware platforms? Apply now to join the team.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.organization-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About the Team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Markets is the real-money prediction and trading app where you can invest in moments you care about. Built on a secure platform, we let users predict real-world outcomes and trade on events they actually follow - from sports and entertainment to political elections and beyond. Our mission is to redefine how fans engage with the moments and markets that matter most. We&#39;re looking for the right people to help us build the future of prediction markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Platform Engineer,&lt;/strong&gt; you operate with broad organizational impact. You will set technical direction, design durable platform abstractions, and partner closely with senior engineers, engineering managers, and product leadership to ensure our platform enables rapid innovation without compromising stability, security, or compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role blends deep hands-on engineering expertise with systems thinking and influence. You will lead complex cross-team initiatives, establish best-in-class platform standards, and mentor engineers while remaining directly involved in building and operating core platform capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On the engineering side, we&#39;re pioneering the use of AI as a code collaborator. We need engineers who have gone beyond experimentation—who actively use Claude Code, Cursor, GitHub Copilot, or similar tools to ship production code faster while maintaining exceptional quality standards. If you have strong opinions about AI-augmented development workflows backed by real experience, we want to talk with you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and document enterprise-wide standards for AI integration, establishing prompt engineering patterns and validation frameworks that scale development velocity without compromising architectural integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate the identification of AI-generated code pitfalls—such as security vulnerabilities and over-abstraction—while quantifying the business impact through PR velocity and quality metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and evolution of highly available, scalable infrastructure, ensuring the platform remains resilient under the demands of multi-disciplinary engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect robust CI/CD ecosystems and developer tooling, focusing on eliminating friction in the software delivery lifecycle and driving organization-wide productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a subject matter expert for platform security, implementing sophisticated safeguards and compliance standards to protect the integrity of the firm’s systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the strategic roadmap for system observability, implementing advanced monitoring, tracing, and alerting architectures to ensure peak operational reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a primary technical liaison between engineering, product, and quantitative teams to translate complex requirements into scalable, innovative platform solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of high performance and continuous learning, mentoring engineers on best practices, managing incident response strategies, and advocating for the adoption of transformative technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8 plus years of experience in platform engineering or DevOps, with a proven track record of architecting scalable, high-availability cloud-native environments (AWS/Kubernetes).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert proficiency in using AI collaborators (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot) to ship production code, with a documented ability to optimize personal and team development workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated capability to articulate the pros/cons of various AI tools and implement rigorous validation strategies to identify pitfalls like over-abstraction or security gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep technical mastery of IaC frameworks such as Terraform, Pulumi, or CloudFormation to automate complex infrastructure lifecycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming proficiency in Java and Python (Golang preferred) with a full-stack background to bridge the gap between infrastructure and application logic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience building mature CI/CD pipelines and implementing advanced observability, chaos testing, and incident management frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-directed leader who thrives in ambiguous environments, balancing high-quality architectural standards with data-driven productivity metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and partnership skills, with a proven ability to influence engineering, product, and quant teams across international borders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team-first mentality focused on driving operational excellence, mentoring others, and proactively adopting emerging technologies to maintain a competitive edge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in high-growth startup environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributions to open-source projects or technical community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with real-money transaction systems and regulatory compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in building developer tools or improving engineering productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading without authority and influencing technical direction across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the role, your interview and onboarding experience may include in-person components, such as onsite interviews or Launching into Better: LIVE—a multi-day cultural immersion in New York City for full-time, non-seasonal hires. These sessions are designed to build connection and bring our culture to life, though specific travel and participation requirements will be confirmed based on your role and location. Your recruiter will provide clear guidance at each stage of the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to build the future of sports betting? If you possess some of these skills but not all of them, we still encourage you to apply!&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;Please note that&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;visa sponsorship is not available&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for this position. We are open to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;fully remote candidates based in the United Kingdom.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Remote employee may also be eligible for a home office setup stipend.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-AL1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.organization-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About the Team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Markets is the real-money prediction and trading app where you can invest in moments you care about. Built on a secure platform, we let users predict real-world outcomes and trade on events they actually follow - from sports and entertainment to political elections and beyond. Our mission is to redefine how fans engage with the moments and markets that matter most. We&#39;re looking for the right people to help us build the future of prediction markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Platform Engineer, &lt;/strong&gt;you will be a key driver of our core infrastructure and developer experience. You will design and implement durable platform abstractions and partner with engineering leads to ensure our systems enable rapid innovation without compromising stability or security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires a balance of deep hands-on engineering and systems thinking. You will own complex features from ideation to production, championing best-in-class platform standards and mentoring mid-level engineers while remaining deeply embedded in the codebase.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On the engineering side, we are pioneering the use of AI as a code collaborator. We need engineers who have moved beyond experimentation—who actively use tools like Claude Code, Cursor, or GitHub Copilot to ship production code faster while maintaining exceptional quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement team-level standards for AI-augmented development, utilizing prompt engineering and validation frameworks to increase velocity without sacrificing code quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and mitigate AI-generated code pitfalls, such as security vulnerabilities or over-abstraction, and assist in tracking team productivity metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain highly available cloud-native infrastructure, ensuring the platform scales reliably with our growing user base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and optimize CI/CD pipelines and developer tooling to eliminate friction in the software delivery lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and maintain platform security safeguards and compliance standards to protect the integrity of the firm’s systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the system observability roadmap by implementing monitoring, tracing, and alerting to ensure high operational reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product and engineering teams to translate technical requirements into scalable platform solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior and mid-level engineers, lead incident response for team-owned services, and advocate for modern engineering best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 plus years of experience in platform engineering, DevOps, or backend engineering, with a track record of building scalable, cloud-native environments (AWS/Kubernetes).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in using AI collaborators (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot) to ship production code and an ability to optimize personal development workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to evaluate AI-generated code for security gaps or architectural &quot;hallucinations&quot; and implement rigorous testing strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on experience with IaC frameworks such as&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Terraform&lt;/strong&gt;, Pulumi, or CloudFormation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High proficiency in Java and Python (Golang is a plus). You should be comfortable bridging the gap between infrastructure and application logic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building mature CI/CD pipelines and working with observability tools (e.g., Prometheus, Grafana, Datadog).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to take ownership of complex projects in a fast-paced environment, balancing speed with architectural health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and the ability to collaborate effectively with distributed engineering and product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in high-growth startup environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with financial systems, real-money transactions, or regulatory compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in building internal developer tools or CLI applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading small project groups or &quot;squads&quot; within a larger team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the role, your interview and onboarding experience may include in-person components, such as onsite interviews or Launching into Better: LIVE—a multi-day cultural immersion in New York City for full-time, non-seasonal hires. These sessions are designed to build connection and bring our culture to life, though specific travel and participation requirements will be confirmed based on your role and location. Your recruiter will provide clear guidance at each stage of the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to build the future of sports betting? If you possess some of these skills but not all of them, we still encourage you to apply!&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;Please note that&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;visa sponsorship is not available&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for this position. We are open to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;fully remote candidates based in the United Kingdom.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Remote employee may also be eligible for a home office setup stipend.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-AL1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join us in building the future of finance.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;634&quot;&gt;About the team + role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;658&quot;&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world’s biggest financial problems. We’re looking for bold thinkers. Sharp problem-solvers. Builders who are wired to make an impact. Robinhood isn’t a place for complacency, it’s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. We’re a high-performing, fast-moving team with ethics at the center of everything we do. Expectations are high, and so are the rewards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1102&quot;&gt;The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1108&quot;&gt;Prime team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1120&quot;&gt;&#39;s mission is to build Bitstamp&#39;s prime brokerage for institutional clients — the platform that lets hedge funds, market makers, and professional trading firms onboard, fund, trade, borrow against, and settle positions at scale. We build the systems that move real institutional money: cross-venue settlement, credit against collateral, matched-book lending, and the bridge that brings tokenized securities to our order book — together with the client- and ops-facing surfaces that make them usable, from institutional onboarding and account configuration to reporting and the backoffice tooling our operations run on every day. These are correctness-critical systems where a wrong answer can&#39;t be cheaply undone — getting them right is the whole job.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1872&quot;&gt;As a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1879&quot;&gt;Senior Full-Stack Software Engineer,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1917&quot;&gt; you will own the design and end-to-end delivery of features across that whole surface — from the Prime backend services down to the frontend and backoffice screens that expose them. You&#39;ll lead other engineers through problems of high ambiguity, set the technical bar for how we build for failure and not just the happy path, and follow a problem across the full institutional lifecycle rather than stopping at a boundary. Flexibility is the job: some weeks that&#39;s a settlement edge case in the backend, others a client onboarding flow or an ops dashboard, and you&#39;re happy owning whichever the work needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2527&quot;&gt;This role is based in our London office, with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2631&quot;&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2860&quot;&gt;Requires participation in an on-call rotation to support business needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2941&quot;&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2960&quot;&gt;Lead the design and end-to-end delivery of features across the stack — from Prime backend services (settlement, on-exchange credit, lending, tokenized securities) through to the frontend and backoffice screens clients and ops teams rely on.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3202&quot;&gt;Own the client- and ops-facing journeys across the institutional lifecycle — onboarding, account configuration, reporting, and the tooling that lets operations run the business safely.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3388&quot;&gt;Author detailed designs and break work into reviewable steps, making failure states, invariants, and recovery explicit before you ship — on flows where a wrong answer moves real money.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3574&quot;&gt;Uplevel the team through design-focused code review and mentorship, and move fluidly between backend and frontend as the work demands rather than handing off at a boundary.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3753&quot;&gt;What you bring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3772&quot;&gt;A track record of independently delivering complex, high-ambiguity projects with long-term impact, operating them in production and owning every line you ship.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3933&quot;&gt;Strong full-stack range in production — a modern backend (we work primarily in Python/Django and Go) and a component-based frontend (we use Vue) — with the judgment to know where a given problem is best solved and a genuine willingness to own whatever the feature needs, wherever it lives in the stack.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4237&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience building financial systems — user balances, ledgers, risk engines, settlement, onboarding/KYC, or payments — where correctness is non-negotiable and mistakes are expensive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4431&quot;&gt;Strong design judgment: you enumerate the failure paths, name your invariants, and can point at the constraint, test, or alert that enforces each one.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4583&quot;&gt;Excellent communication: you drive alignment across teams and stakeholders, give substantive design-level review feedback, and mentor engineers to raise the bar around you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4762&quot;&gt;🎁 What we offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4815&quot;&gt;Challenging, high-impact work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4846&quot;&gt; to grow your career and shape the future of global institutional finance &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4980&quot;&gt;Performance-driven compensation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;5013&quot;&gt; with multipliers for outsized impact, bonus programs, and equity ownership &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;5149&quot;&gt;Top-tier health benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;5175&quot;&gt; to fuel your work, including 100% employer-paid private medical insurance for you and comprehensive coverage for dependents, alongside mental health and wellbeing support programs &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;5417&quot;&gt;Aviva Pension Scheme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;5439&quot;&gt; with highly competitive company matching to secure your future &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;5565&quot;&gt;Lifestyle Wallet:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;5584&quot;&gt; A highly flexible employer-paid benefits spending account to offset expenses like wellness, learning, childcare, and more &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;5769&quot;&gt;Access to the best AI tools&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;5798&quot;&gt; on the market with continuous AI skill-building opportunities for all employees &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;5941&quot;&gt;Time to recharge:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;5960&quot;&gt; Generous paid time off, company holidays, sick time, parental leave, and paid volunteer time off &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;6120&quot;&gt;Exceptional office experience:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;6152&quot;&gt; Catered meals, fully stocked snacks, team social events, and modern workspaces in our London location&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about our Total Rewards, which vary by region and entity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If our mission energizes you and you’re ready to build the future of finance, we look forward to seeing your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Usage Disclosure:&lt;/strong&gt; Robinhood uses artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support parts of our recruiting process. These tools enhance the efficiency and consistency of our hiring process; however, all hiring decisions are made by our hiring teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robinhood provides equal opportunity for all applicants, offers reasonable accommodations upon request, and complies with applicable equal employment and privacy laws. Inclusion is built into how we hire and work—welcoming different backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences so everyone can do their best. Please review the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/applicantprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for your country of application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;VML&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Model: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sea Containers office, London, SE1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At VML, we are a beacon of innovation and growth in an ever-evolving world. Our heritage is built upon a century of combined expertise, where creativity meets technology, and diverse perspectives ignite inspiration. With the merger of VMLY&amp;amp;R and Wunderman Thompson, we have forged a new path as a growth partner that is part creative agency, part consultancy, and part technology powerhouse.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our global family now encompasses over 30,000 employees across 150+ offices in 64 markets, each contributing to a culture that values connection, belonging, and the power of differences. Our expertise spans the entire customer journey building connected brands that drive growth for our clients. We do this by leveraging our 3 core practices; Brand experience, Customer experience and Commerce. Within these practices we offer expertise across communications, commerce, consultancy, CRM, data, production, and technology. We deliver end-to-end solutions that result in revolutionary work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role: Senior Copywriter&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a senior writer, to work on one of the world’s leading car groups – covering a range of brands on their roster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate needs to be a conceptually sound creative with a history of big ideas. A specialist in copywriting who has worked through the line, and is not afraid to get stuck in at the lower end of the funnel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The day-to-day ask is to work on developing standout copy for a range of CRM communications – Direct Mail, Email, SMS, MMS and digital &amp;amp; social.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond that you will have creative opportunities to expand your thinking across other mediums, being more conceptual, as we look to expand the brands beyond CRM.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will be experienced in creating compelling content that elevates engagement, enhances customer loyalty, and drives business revenue. You will collaborate closely with marketing specialists, content strategists, and designers to create click-worthy email campaigns, persuasive marketing messages, and compelling CRM content. This role requires a keen understanding of customer behaviour and excellent copywriting skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drafting and editing high-quality CRM content for newsletters, emails, landing pages, and other digital platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with cross-functional teams to improve content strategy and drive customer engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analysing customer data to understand audience needs and preferences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring brand consistency in style and adhering to tone of voice in all CRM communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being a brand guardian of the several different tones across the portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being a mentor to junior/midweight writers in the team, helping them develop their copywriting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Presenting to and working closely with clients on copy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being conceptual, creating big ideas across a number of brands in the group, that push CRM communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience as a Copywriter, CRM specialist, or similar role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpreting and adopting the writing style of our brand/s&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in content management systems and CRM tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with creating and optimizing SEO content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to meet deadlines while maintaining high-quality work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expresses copy with clarity; on brand; on message and targeted to audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Presents ideas and copy to both the wider internal team and, occasionally, externally to clients with structure and parity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehends and understands brand continuity, brand guidelines and brand positioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drives, defines and feeds back on quality of briefs, regular reviews, feedback channels, creative quality and collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identifies opportunities for creative work to be performed for clients, with guidance from seniors and directors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executes creative copy at the direction of the creative director&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aside from a generous annual leave allowance and pension allowances, you will have access to a whole host of other benefits and activities such as&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Permanent Health Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BUPA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible hybrid-working schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced family friendly policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Well-being Programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to Work Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eye Care and Glasses Vouchers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Season Ticket Loans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;WPP Discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will also have a clear long-term career development plan and access to our learning and development activities and online learning platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity, Equity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without regard to race, colour, religion or belief, sex, age, national origin, citizenship status, marital status, military/veteran status, genetic information, sexual orientation, gender identity or physical or mental disability. We believe in creating a dynamic work environment that values diversity and inclusion and strives to recruit a diverse slate of candidates to help us achieve that goal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you are unable or limited in your ability to access our career site as a result of a disability, we will be happy to assist you. Please contact our People Team at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ---------- &lt;/a&gt;to request an alternate accommodation. Please note that only requests for an employment application accommodation will be returned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;The Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Growth Managing Director, you will own a defined enterprise growth domain and are personally accountable for hunting, triaging, shaping and progressing live WPP Enterprise Solutions opportunities within it. Large organisations create ambiguity. Your job is not to manage it internally; it is to resolve it commercially.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an active commercial role, not a strategic advisory one. You sit close to live client work, and your value is measured by the momentum you create: turning relationships, market signals and direct client needs into qualified, moving ES opportunities. You are a senior commercial operator who does not wait for a brief to arrive in its final form or for the organisation to clear a path before you act. You find the signal, you qualify it, you shape it, and you drive it forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is as much for the person ready to step into full commercial ownership as it is for the seasoned enterprise growth operator. What we are looking for is not a specific tenure; it is a specific kind of commercial maturity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Core Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Identify &amp;amp; Qualify:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a defined area of Enterprise Growth, such as WPP Media, WPP Creative, GCL / Top Accounts, WPP Open / Data / AI, Enterprise Growth Architecture, Commercial Architecture or Solution Architecture and take personal accountability for everything that moves within it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively identify and pursue ES growth opportunities through WPP relationships, direct client signals, agency teams, GCLs, platform opportunities, partner motions and enterprise transformation needs, not waiting for leads to come to you, but going to find them before anyone else has&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly and consistently with client leaders, GCLs, agency leaders, media and creative leadership, consulting teams, partner teams and ES capability owners; building the kind of trust that means you are called first, not copied in later&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Shape &amp;amp; Pursue:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess opportunity fit, revenue potential, urgency, readiness, route to client, stakeholder access, competitive context and activation requirements, with the rigour and speed to know quickly what to pursue, what to park and what to pass on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create clear problem statements, opportunity briefs, points of view, value hypotheses, stakeholder maps and pursuit recommendations, giving live opportunities the strategic structure and narrative they need to move forward with confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead discovery, workshops, executive conversations, proposal direction, credentials, pilots and pitch development where needed, owning the early stages that determine whether an opportunity gains real traction or quietly loses momentum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own &amp;amp; Build:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring together ES capabilities across CRM, commerce, CX, content, data, AI, platforms, media, measurement, marketing technology and managed services; assembling the right combination of expertise around a live opportunity rather than defaulting to a generic response&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain ownership of next actions and commercial momentum until the opportunity is ready for formal pursuit, activation, handoff or expansion, ensuring nothing stalls because no one was accountable for the next step&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify repeatable themes, playbook needs, case study requirements and market signals that help WPP Enterprise Solutions scale its growth motion, contributing to the system that makes the next opportunity easier to find, shape and win&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Who you are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a senior growth leader equally at home in a strategy conversation, a client meeting, a commercial negotiation and the execution that follows, because for you, these are not separate modes; they are the same job&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build trust quickly with senior stakeholders and navigate complex global matrix environments without losing pace or clarity, moving across lines of authority and geography as a natural part of how you work, not as an obstacle you manage around&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring genuine domain fluency in one or more of media, creative, consulting, platforms, marketing technology, CRM, commerce, data, AI, content or transformation, enough to be credible in client conversations, not simply directionally informed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can spot opportunity patterns before they become obvious, qualify what deserves your energy and resist the temptation to turn ambiguity into internal process noise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are high-agency, collaborative and commercially mature, able to move across teams, create momentum and make things happen without waiting for perfect structure or explicit permission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll need&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring typically 12 to 15 or more years of experience across enterprise growth, strategic account growth, consulting, technology transformation, digital transformation, media transformation, agency leadership, enterprise sales or client leadership, with a career that has consistently placed you at the point where commercial decisions are made, not downstream of them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have direct experience originating or shaping opportunities with measurable revenue potential, and you can point to them specifically, not just describe them in aggregate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand how enterprise clients buy transformation, technology, marketing, data, customer experience and managed services solutions, not as an academic proposition, but from having sat across the table from the people making those decisions and learned how they actually think&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your background may have been built inside WPP operating companies, major agency networks, consulting firms, systems integrators, digital transformation firms, technology companies, media networks or platform businesses. What matters is whether that background taught you how to find opportunity, qualify it honestly and move it forward in a complex, high-pressure commercial environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a proven ability to work across senior clients and internal stakeholders across multiple disciplines and markets, and a track record that reflects genuine accountability for commercial outcomes, not just meaningful involvement in them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;The Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Growth Group Director, you will be a senior hands-on growth operator whose value is measured in progress: moving live opportunities forward, giving early signals the structure and commercial credibility they need to become real ES pursuits, and keeping momentum alive when it would otherwise stall.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be client-facing, independently capable and expected to shape work. You will develop opportunity materials, run disciplined triage, accelerate live pursuits and connect client needs directly to ES capabilities. You will work with MDs, EDs, GCLs, agencies, client teams and ES capability leaders not as an internal resource to be directed, but as a skilled growth operator who can manage senior stakeholder interactions, build opportunity narratives and hold your own in the conversations that determine whether an opportunity moves or dies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is a strong fit for experienced operators who bring a blend of consulting, technology, agency, client services, strategic account, sales or transformation experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Core Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Find &amp;amp; Filter:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with senior growth leaders to identify ES growth signals across priority accounts, WPP relationships, client teams, market triggers and direct enterprise opportunities, bringing your own initiative and commercial instinct to the search rather than simply following direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess whether an opportunity has a clear client need, ES relevance, value potential, stakeholder access, urgency, winnability and a credible next action. You bring enough commercial judgement to give an honest, well-reasoned recommendation rather than a neutral summary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop opportunity briefs, problem statements, stakeholder maps, account views, discovery questions, value hypotheses and pursuit narratives, producing materials that are precise, client-ready and immediately usable by the senior leaders and client stakeholders who need them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Shape &amp;amp; Accelerate:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support discovery meetings, workshops, pitch preparation, proposal direction, client-ready points of view and immediate follow-up actions, keeping pursuits moving at the pace they require and ensuring nothing loses momentum in the gaps between conversations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply knowledge across one or more of media, creative, CRM, commerce, CX, content, data, AI, platforms, marketing technology, managed services or operating model transformation, with enough depth to add genuine value in client conversations rather than simply providing context&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with ES capability leaders, solution experts, commercial leads, partner teams and delivery SMEs to clarify the opportunity and define the required activation path, knowing who to bring in, when to bring them and how to brief them well&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clarify &amp;amp; Build:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn ambiguous inputs into clear, high-quality material that can support senior client and internal conversations. The standard is not that the material exists, but that it is good enough to use without revision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture patterns, proof points, cases and market themes that help the broader team move faster on similar opportunities, contributing to a growth system that gets sharper with everything you learn and produce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a clear, current view of opportunity value, stage, next action, conversion risk and required decision points, treating commercial discipline not as reporting overhead but as the operating standard of the role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Who you are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an experienced client-facing operator with the maturity to work directly with senior internal and client stakeholders. You are not the most junior person in the room seeking guidance; you are someone whose perspective and output are expected to move the conversation forward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable in ambiguity and able to structure problems and move work forward without waiting for full instruction. At this level, the brief is rarely complete, the path is rarely clear, and the value you add is precisely your ability to create order from that uncertainty&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are commercially minded and outcome-focused, with a genuine instinct for what has real revenue potential and what should be qualified out before it consumes energy it will not justify&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a strong writer and thinker who can translate complex transformation topics into sharp, usable opportunity materials. In this role, the quality of your thinking is visible in everything you produce, and the standard is whether a senior client or leader can pick it up and use it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are collaborative, practical and proactive, able to work across GCLs, agencies, consulting, technology, platform and ES capability teams without needing a formal authority structure to create momentum or a complete brief to begin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll need&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You typically bring 10 to 12 or more years of experience across strategic account management, growth, consulting, technology transformation, digital transformation, client services, business development, enterprise sales, media, creative, data, CRM, commerce or CX, with a track record that reflects genuine contribution to commercial outcomes rather than simply proximity to them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have direct experience supporting or leading client conversations, opportunity qualification, discovery, proposal development, pitch preparation or pursuit acceleration. You understand what separates a conversation that progresses from one that politely goes nowhere&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand how large organisations identify, fund and buy transformation, technology, marketing or customer experience work. This is not a theoretical framework for you; it is a practical reality you have navigated with real clients making real decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can move across complex internal organisations and connect multiple capabilities around one client opportunity, working through ambiguity of structure and authority without losing sight of the commercial objective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in a consulting firm, agency network, technology business, systems integrator, digital transformation firm, media network, WPP operating company or enterprise client environment gives you relevant and valuable context. What matters most is whether that background sharpened your ability to spot opportunity, qualify it honestly, produce high-quality materials and create the momentum that moves a pursuit forward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a global creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce to create connected brands&amp;nbsp;that drive growth. Guided by a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Human First&lt;/strong&gt; philosophy, VML is known for its innovative work for brands and consistently ranks among the world’s leading creative companies, including the WARC Creative 100.&amp;nbsp;VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d4b7d1c3-8ad6-4b6d-ab45-d3cb5a3aebe1&quot;&gt;www.vml.com &lt;/a&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;a3ef68bf-16fb-4ebc-9ca9-406007d6cefc&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;The Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Growth Network Director, you will hold one of the most senior and consequential commercial roles within WPP Enterprise Solutions. You will be responsible for turning the most valuable market signals, client relationships, and WPP network intelligence into high-quality, strategically shaped growth opportunities and for creating the momentum that moves them from first conversation to qualified pursuit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operating at the intersection of consultative selling, transformation strategy, and executive relationship management, you will bring a rare combination of commercial instinct and intellectual rigour. You do not wait for a brief to arrive fully formed. You identify signals others miss, impose strategic clarity where ambiguity exists, shape the opportunity narrative before the client has fully articulated the need, and mobilise the right combination of WPP expertise around a live, credible commercial path. This is enterprise growth leadership in its most active and most demanding form.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working fluidly across WPP Network Growth, you will engage at the highest levels of the organisation and the market, operating credibly alongside Global Client Leads, agency CEOs, senior client stakeholders, consulting and technology partners, and ES capability heads. Your effectiveness will be measured not by the volume of relationships you manage, but by the quality of the opportunities you originate, the rigour with which you qualify and shape them, and your ability to connect the right people, at the right moment, around the right commercial proposition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Core Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Generate:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and progress high-value opportunities across existing WPP relationships, direct enterprise demand, senior stakeholder networks and strategic market signals, converting early intelligence into commercially viable pursuits before the opportunity has fully formed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build genuine, durable trust at the highest levels with Global Client Leads, agency leaders, WPP Media, WPP Creative, WPP Open, consulting and alliance partners, and senior client stakeholders, creating the access and relationships that sustain commercial momentum over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess each live opportunity with commercial discipline and strategic clarity, evaluating client need, ES relevance, revenue potential, urgency, stakeholder access, winnability and the required path to activation so that the team&#39;s energy is concentrated where it matters most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Shape:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate ambiguous client problems into a clear, compelling Enterprise Solutions opportunity narrative, spanning CRM, commerce, CX, content, data, AI, platforms, marketing technology, managed services and operating model transformation, making the complex feel navigable and the case for action feel urgent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the pursuit strategy for priority opportunities from end to end; owning problem framing, stakeholder mapping, commercial logic, solution direction, proof points and activation needs and carry that strategy through to a result&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know exactly when and how to bring in solution, commercial, technical, delivery, alliance and subject-matter expertise, assembling the right combination of people at the right point in the opportunity lifecycle, not before they add value and not after the moment has passed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Activate &amp;amp; Lead:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear, decisive leadership readouts on priority opportunities, covering blockers, decision points, commercial potential, next actions and escalation needs and ensuring senior stakeholders always have an accurate, current picture of where the most important pursuits stand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define how WPP Enterprise Solutions shows up to the network and to enterprise clients as a credible transformation and growth partner, contributing not just to individual opportunities but to the commercial infrastructure and positioning that makes future growth possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set a high bar for MD and Group Director colleagues across opportunity quality, client readiness, strategic thinking and commercial discipline, multiplying your impact well beyond your own pipeline and raising the performance of the team around you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Who you are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an executive-level growth leader with a demonstrated record of creating and converting large enterprise opportunities, not inheriting them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You operate with credibility in complex matrix environments, moving fluently across consulting, technology, agency, platform, media, creative and client leadership groups, adapting your register without losing your point of view&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are commercially sharp and consultative in equal measure, equally comfortable shaping a transformation strategy at the outset and driving the commercial execution that turns it into a win&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your executive presence is substantive, not performative. You can simplify complex transformation topics for senior client and internal audiences without losing the depth that makes your perspective worth having&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an entrepreneurial operator, capable of building a new growth motion from the ground up while advancing live opportunities that cannot wait for the infrastructure to be in place&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll need&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You typically bring 15 or more years of experience across enterprise growth, transformation consulting, technology consulting, digital transformation, marketing transformation, integrated agency leadership, strategic sales or complex client leadership, with a career that has consistently placed you in rooms where large, complex decisions were being made&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have worked directly with C-suite and senior enterprise stakeholders across marketing, technology, customer, operations, data, AI, commerce and transformation agendas and with enough regularity that it is your natural operating environment, not an occasional stretch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your background may have been built inside a consulting firm, systems integrator, technology business, digital transformation firm, large agency network, media network, WPP operating company or enterprise sales organisation. The path matters less than what it gave you: commercial depth, network credibility and the strategic range to operate at the level this role demands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have direct experience shaping large pursuits, managing strategic accounts, navigating multi-market opportunities, driving partner-led growth or leading multi-capability transformation programmes, and you understand the difference between being close to those efforts and being accountable for them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hold yourself and others to a high standard across revenue accountability, pipeline discipline, complex stakeholder management and opportunity qualification, not as processes you follow, but as disciplines that define how you work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Wheely&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wheely is redefining premium transportation across major cities in Europe, the US, and the Middle East. We blend cutting-edge technology with the craft of five-star chauffeuring to deliver an experience trusted by more than 100,000 active riders and 1,200 corporate accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a profitable, fast-growing scale-up with $43M raised and over $100M in annual revenue. Having recently launched in New York City, we’re expanding rapidly across the US and EMEA. If you take pride in your craft and want to help shape the next chapter of our growth, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a skilled &lt;strong&gt;Technical Lead Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join one of our dynamic technical teams, such as Passenger, Billing, etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing the team of ~10 developers on a day-to-day basis: participating in planning, project management, delivery, career development for DRs, hiring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect M- and L- sized features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with cross-functional teams (designers, testers, product managers) to gather requirements and discuss project goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the analysis, design and evaluation of technical requirements together with the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, scalable, and efficient code mainly in Go language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and give feedback on code written by peers to ensure consistency, readability, and efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and maintain technical documentation, including software design documents and user guides&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience developing scalable and reliable backend services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Go/Ruby/Python/C++/Java/Kotlin languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth knowledge of common databases and messaging systems like PostgreSQL/MongoDB/Redis/Kafka/RabbitMQ, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upper-Intermediate or higher English proficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our current stack:&lt;/strong&gt; Go microservices, shrinking Ruby monolith, Node.js, MongoDB, PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, Thrift, Redis, AWS, Terraform, K8s, Jenkins.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Office-based role in West London, four days a week with flexible start and finish times, plus one remote day of your choice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary: £130,000 – £160,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee stock options plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical and dental insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life and critical illness cover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Latest-generation MacBook Pro and 4k display&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly credit towards Wheely journeys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to Work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation support, including visa sponsorship and allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;All of your personal information will be collected stored and processed in accordance with&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://wheely.com/en/legal/uk/for-candidates/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Wheely’s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Wheely&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wheely is redefining premium transportation across major cities in Europe, the US, and the Middle East. We blend cutting-edge technology with the craft of five-star chauffeuring to deliver an experience trusted by more than 100,000 active riders and 1,200 corporate accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a profitable, fast-growing scale-up with $43M raised and over $100M in annual revenue. Having recently launched in New York City, we’re expanding rapidly across the US and EMEA. If you take pride in your craft and want to help shape the next chapter of our growth, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over the past few years, we have rebuilt our infrastructure almost from scratch. And now we are expanding the infrastructure team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a part of the team, you will work to minimize the number of incidents (availability, performance, security), speed up time-to-delivery of new features to customers, building flexible, high availability, and protected infrastructure to ensure every customer’s journey or request runs smoothly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;PyJv1b gsmt PZPZlf qRofMd&quot; data-attrid=&quot;title&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CA8QAQ&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;yKMVIe&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with alerts and incidents that arise in the system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist development teams with emerging issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate work and write documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the creation of application pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the migration of infrastructure and application services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, maintain and ensure system resilience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop dynamic environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-dobid=&quot;hdw&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-dobid=&quot;hdw&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech stack:&lt;/strong&gt; AWS, Kubernetes, MongoDB, PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, Redis, Ansible, Terraform, Grafana, Prometheus, Sentry, Loki, Jenkins, Github Actions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience with cloud-based solutions (AWS/GCP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Linux troubleshooting, including networking and file systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in infrastructure automation using Ansible, Terraform, Bash, Python, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with containers and platforms such as Docker, Kubernetes, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with administration RabbitMQ/Kafka&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with administration of SQL/NoSQL databases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good writing and verbal communication skills to ensure efficient communication within and outside the team and to explain your decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to focus on what matters most, manage your time, and get things done&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To be a team player, ready to help engineers investigate issues or teach them new things&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love to automate manual work and try new modern technology/approaches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we Offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Office-based role in West London, four days a week with flexible start and finish times, plus one remote day of your choice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary: £90,000 – £120,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee stock options plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical and dental insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life and critical illness cover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Latest-generation MacBook Pro and 4k display&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly credit towards Wheely journeys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to Work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation support, including visa sponsorship and allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;All of your personal information will be collected stored and processed in accordance with&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://wheely.com/en/legal/uk/for-candidates/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Wheely’s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Wheely&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wheely is redefining premium transportation across major cities in Europe, the US, and the Middle East. We blend cutting-edge technology with the craft of five-star chauffeuring to deliver an experience trusted by more than 100,000 active riders and 1,200 corporate accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a profitable, fast-growing scale-up with $43M raised and over $100M in annual revenue. Having recently launched in New York City, we’re expanding rapidly across the US and EMEA. If you take pride in your craft and want to help shape the next chapter of our growth, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wheely is growing rapidly, and events are an increasingly important part of how we build the brand, deepen customer relationships and introduce Wheely to new audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We partner with some of the most prestigious events across the London calendar, including Royal Ascot, Frieze, the Giorgio Armani Tennis Classic, Goodwood Revival, Henley Royal Regatta, and more. As Senior Events Manager, you will play a key role in bringing these partnerships to life and ensuring Wheely shows up at every event in a way that is distinctive, premium, and exceptional.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Partnerships Director and working closely with the Head of Creative &amp;amp; Brand, you will own the end-to-end delivery of our London events programme - taking partnership opportunities and creative concepts from brief through to flawless execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will manage agencies, suppliers, venues, partners, and internal teams, while owning timelines, budgets, production, and on-the-ground execution. You will also be responsible for identifying opportunities within each event to attract new customers, deepen existing customer relationships and enhance the overall Wheely experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly hands-on role for someone with excellent organisational skills, strong commercial judgement, and an obsessive attention to detail. You will be responsible for ensuring every event feels seamless, sophisticated, and unmistakably Wheely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end delivery of Wheely&#39;s London events, from brief through to post-event evaluation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn partnership and creative briefs into detailed event plans, and flawless execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage event agencies, production companies, venues, suppliers, and other external partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own event budgets, negotiate costs, and ensure delivery within agreed budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate internal teams across Brand, Marketing, Operations, Sales, and Partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Partnerships Director to deliver partner requirements and commercial objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Head of Creative &amp;amp; Brand to bring the creative vision to life to an exceptional standard, ensuring brand standards are upheld&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage all event logistics, production, guest experience, staffing and on-site operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead events on the ground, taking ownership of delivery and resolving issues as they arise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and create touchpoints within events that introduce new audiences to Wheely and encourage customer acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Look for opportunities throughout the event journey to deepen relationships with existing customers and enhance their experience with Wheely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously raise the quality of Wheely&#39;s events and improve how we plan and deliver them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years&#39; experience in events, experiential, luxury hospitality, brand activations or a similar environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience independently delivering premium events from brief through to execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience managing agencies, suppliers, venues and event budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional project management and organisational skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Impeccable attention to detail and a strong eye for quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder and relationship management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial awareness and confidence negotiating with suppliers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive and solutions-oriented, particularly under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable taking ownership and working independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with luxury or premium brands strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to work evenings and weekends when required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Success in This Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success will mean consistently delivering exceptional London events — on time, on budget and to an outstanding standard — while building trusted relationships with our partners, agencies and suppliers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why Join Wheely&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the delivery of Wheely&#39;s London events programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Partnerships Director and Head of Creative &amp;amp; Brand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create exceptional experiences across London&#39;s luxury, hospitality, and cultural landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant ownership and visibility within a fast-growing premium brand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Office-based role in West London, four days a week with flexible start and finish times, plus one remote day of your choice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee stock options plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical and dental insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life and critical illness cover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Best-in-class equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly credit towards Wheely journeys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to Work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;All of your personal information will be collected stored and processed in accordance with&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://wheely.com/en/legal/uk/for-candidates/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Wheely’s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

