&lt;p&gt;Senior Data Engineer, Proprietary Research&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;London&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Career with Point72&#39;s Market Intelligence team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On our proprietary research team—Market Intelligence— you will uncover insights about markets and the broader economy through deep compliant fundamental research and applying data science and engineering techniques to alternative data sets. In partnership with our investment professionals and Compliance team, our team of analysts, data scientists and engineers work together to produce compliant research and build tools that inform our firm’s investments. We look for other bright, motivated, and collaborative people to join our team and grow with us—a majority of the leaders in our group were promoted from within.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with investment professionals, researchers, and data scientists to design, build, and launch robust end-to-end business solutions including data pipelines, products and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and develop big data processing pipelines including but not limited to ingestion, transformation, trends creation to deliver AI-ready data assets &amp;amp; products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reusable software components, libraries, and APIs that enable rapid experimentation and production deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement data quality, lineage, and governance controls to ensure datasets are reliable, auditable, and compliant with compliance policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable AI-native cloud-based infrastructure using distributed systems techniques, to deliver efficient data-driven business solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize performance, cost, and reliability of software systems through benchmarking and iterative improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT’S REQUIRED&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in Data Engineering, Software Engineering or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of strong experience in Python development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with system design and leading multi-person development efforts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with distributed data processing frameworks like Spark&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with building scalable APIs, and software applications w/ focus on backend infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud platforms and services for data storage and compute (for example AWS, Google Cloud Platform, or Azure)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with orchestration technologies like Airflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of/experience with langraph/langchain or similar frameworks, embedding models, vector, graph databases is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong drive to staying current with AI advancements and translating emerging techniques into practical, real-world applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to the highest ethical standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We take care of our people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest in our people, their careers, their health, and their well-being. When you work here, we provide:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical and Dental Insurances&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous parental and family leave policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteer opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support for employee-led affinity groups representing women, people of colour and the LGBQT+ community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental and physical wellness programmes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition assistance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Non-contributory pension and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Point72&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Point72 is a leading global alternative investment firm led by Steven A. Cohen. Building on more than 30 years of investing experience, Point72 seeks to deliver superior returns for its investors through fundamental and systematic investing strategies across asset classes and geographies. We aim to attract and retain the industry&#39;s brightest talent by cultivating an investor-led culture and committing to our people&#39;s long-term growth. For more information, visit https://point72.com/&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Tenstorrent is leading the industry on cutting-edge AI technology, revolutionizing performance expectations, ease of use, and cost efficiency. With AI redefining the computing paradigm, solutions must evolve to unify innovations in software models, compilers, platforms, networking, and semiconductors. Our diverse team of technologists have developed a high performance RISC-V CPU from scratch, and share a passion for AI and a deep desire to build the best AI platform possible. We value collaboration, curiosity, and a commitment to solving hard problems. We are growing our team and looking for contributors of all seniorities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnte&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Our Tensix team is building custom AI compute cores, RISC-V CPUs, and chiplet-based architectures for datacenter, edge, and automotive AI. Design Verification Engineers on this team validate compute IP and subsystems and build scalable DV infrastructure to keep verification fast, automated, and production-grade.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnte&quot;&gt;This role is hybrid, based out of Toronto, ON, Austin, TX or Belgrade, Serbia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnte&quot;&gt;We welcome candidates at various experience levels for this role. During the interview process, candidates will be assessed for the appropriate level, and offers will align with that level, which may differ from the one in this posting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnte&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnte&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in modern verification methodologies with strong SystemVerilog skills and exposure to structured testbench development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working from block-level to system-level verification and reasoning about microarchitecture behavior from specs and waveforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Linux environments with Python, or Bash scripting for automate builds, parse logs, manage CI pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in coverage-driven verification and confident debugging across RTL, testbench, and workload scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated by AI hardware and eager to learn verification strategies for new architectures and domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;1&quot; data-border-radius-top-cap=&quot;0&quot; data-border-radius-bottom-cap=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to verification of Tensix IP and subsystems from early planning through tape-out, owning coverage goals and driving them to closure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain reusable verification environments, agents, scoreboards, and supporting infrastructure in SystemVerilog and Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop constrained-random and directed tests and close functional, code, and assertion coverage using data-driven approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debug complex issues across RTL and testbench while collaborating with design, firmware, compiler, and architecture teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help evolve DV infrastructure including regression flows, CI/CD integration, EDA compute environments, and reproducible setups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: Exposure to functional safety (FuSa) verification concepts for automotive AI workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: Familiarity with formal verification methodologies, SVA (SystemVerilog Assertions), or formal property verification for complex control logic and microarchitectural corner cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Learn&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;1&quot; data-border-radius-top-cap=&quot;0&quot; data-border-radius-bottom-cap=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How Tenstorrent verifies AI-native compute architectures including Tensix cores, RISC-V CPUs, matrix units, vector units, and datapath.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How simulation, emulation, and software-driven workloads combine to validate both functional correctness and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How numerical precision formats such as BF16, FP4, and INT8 and on-chip dataflow impact verification complexity and coverage strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How to build scalable DV infrastructure across hybrid compute environments including containerized regression systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How data analytics and modern AI tooling can enhance verification workflows and accelerate convergence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdnte&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Compensation for all engineers at Tenstorrent ranges from $100k - $500k including base and variable compensation targets. Experience, skills, education, background and location all impact the actual offer made.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tenstorrent offers a highly competitive compensation package and benefits, and we are an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This offer of employment is contingent upon the applicant being eligible to access U.S. export-controlled technology. &amp;nbsp;Due to U.S. export laws, including those codified in the U.S. Export Administration Regulations (EAR), the Company is required to ensure compliance with these laws when transferring technology to nationals of certain countries (such as EAR Country Groups D:1, E1, and E2). &amp;nbsp; These requirements apply to persons located in the U.S. and all countries outside the U.S. &amp;nbsp;As the position offered will have direct and/or indirect access to information, systems, or technologies subject to these laws, the offer may be contingent upon your citizenship/permanent residency status or ability to obtain prior license approval from the U.S. Commerce Department or applicable federal agency. &amp;nbsp;If employment is not possible due to U.S. export laws, any offer of employment will be rescinded.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Principal data strategists at Thoughtworks are experienced consultants who work with clients to create winning data solutions that meet business goals. They play a pivotal role in developing modern data architecture approaches that directly address our clients&#39; key business objectives. Their responsibilities span in-depth reviews of current data and technology strategy, targeted data strategy, guiding clients to unlock the full potential of data, and providing high-level roadmaps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role entails a mix of advisory responsibilities in data strategy and governance, coupled with a solid delivery-lead role and a breadth of data and AI ecosystem expertise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a client-facing, builder&#39;s leadership role. You will start with a small, senior team and grow it through technical depth, delivery excellence and thought leadership, rather than inheriting a large organisation to manage. The role is based in Germany and requires regular travel to client sites, up to approximately 50% of your time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will collaborate closely with clients to understand their business ecosystem and goals, and co-create data and technology strategies aligned with their objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will help define a clear vision for the client enterprise to become data-driven and aligned with the overall business strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will consult on complex data programs, providing technical leadership and guidance as a data subject-matter expert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will lead and interact with clients across various domains, addressing challenging problems, and collaborate with sales to turn them into viable solutions and winning proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will act as a translator between business, data and IT, and communicate data strategy to senior client stakeholders, including C-level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will own the creation of end-to-end viable data solutions, keeping in mind long-term impacts and overseeing program inceptions for new product development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be responsible for formulating data governance strategies addressing security, privacy and compliance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will enable capability building in data strategy and governance, growing the next generation of data strategists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will create differentiated assets in data strategy and governance to take to market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You lead through influence rather than headcount: growing capability and raising delivery standards inside the organisation, while building our presence in the market through thought leadership, ecosystem initiatives and client-facing points of view.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have extensive experience as a consultant, with a proven track record of creating data strategy and solutions that drive business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have solid experience with data platforms and technologies, and can provide advisory and consultative guidance for clients and cross-delivery teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience engaging with C-level stakeholders to influence and enable the operationalization of an enterprise-wide data strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have demonstrated leadership abilities, with the capacity to lead technical teams and drive projects to successful completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are flexible and adaptable across a variety of projects, leveraging technical expertise and leadership to maximise impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a track record of ensuring proper data governance policies, including data lineage, quality checks and classification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with AI and ML use cases and landscapes and can influence the build of the right solutions to harness insights from data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience building high-level solution frameworks, leveraging paradigms such as data-as-a-product and federated governance where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have professional working proficiency in German (B2 minimum, C1 strongly preferred) and can build consensus with mostly technical stakeholders. Exceptional candidates with outstanding data and AI consulting credentials may be considered where German is not yet at this level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consulting and commercial track record&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have worked in a consultancy or professional-services environment within the last five years, driving data and AI engagements end to end (recent examples matter more than historical ones).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can point to data and AI pursuits you helped win and shape within the last three to five years, including deals from around €3M upwards, and you can speak concretely to their commercial shape, trade-offs and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have grown a practice, capability or go-to-market asset, for example a reusable accelerator taken to market, combining solutioning, sales and delivery with tangible business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You stay conversant with the technology and hands-on enough in at least one relevant area to earn technical credibility with client and delivery teams, while leading primarily on strategy and advisory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring significant hands-on and leadership experience in data and AI (typically 10+ years) and, above all, the appetite to keep building: growing accounts, teams and capability rather than only overseeing them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand the importance of stakeholder management and can easily liaise between clients and other key stakeholders, ensuring buy-in and gaining trust along the way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are resilient in ambiguous situations and can adapt your role to approach challenges from multiple perspectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You don&#39;t shy away from risks or conflicts, instead you take them on and skillfully manage them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You coach, mentor and motivate others and aspire to influence teammates to take positive action and accountability for their work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy influencing others and always advocate for technical excellence while being open to change when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivating strong partnerships comes naturally to you; you understand how relationship building brings new opportunities to our business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have professional working proficiency in German (B2 minimum, C1 strongly preferred) and can build consensus with mostly technical stakeholders. Exceptional candidates with outstanding data and AI consulting credentials may be considered where German is not yet at this level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Other things to know&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There is no one-size-fits-all career path at Thoughtworks: however you want to develop your career is entirely up to you. But we also balance autonomy with the strength of our cultivation culture. This means your career is supported by interactive tools, numerous development programs and teammates who want to help you grow. We see value in helping each other be our best and that extends to empowering our employees in their career journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsible Use of AI in Recruitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Thoughtworks, we use AI tools to support our recruitment team with administrative tasks such as drafting communications, scheduling interviews and writing job descriptions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Crucially, our AI tools do not screen, assess, rank or make hiring decisions. Every application is reviewed by our team and all selection decisions are made exclusively by our interviewers and hiring managers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to fairness and responsible AI. We actively manage our AI systems by testing, monitoring for biased outcomes and implementing mitigation measures. We hold our third-party vendors to these same high standards through a rigorous governance process. For additional information, please see our full Thoughtworks AI Policy for Recruitment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Thoughtworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thoughtworks is a dynamic and inclusive community of bright and supportive colleagues who are revolutionizing tech. As a leading technology consultancy, we&#39;re pushing boundaries through our purposeful and impactful work. For 30+ years, we&#39;ve delivered extraordinary impact together with our clients by helping them solve complex business problems with technology as the differentiator. Bring your brilliant expertise and commitment for continuous learning to Thoughtworks. Together, let&#39;s be extraordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/careers/ai-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;See here our AI policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;Who is Artefact?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming organisations through data and AI. We combine the rigour of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in data, digital and analytics to help clients achieve tangible business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With 2,500+ consultants, data scientists and engineers, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange and Sanofi. Our Swiss offices are at the heart of Artefact’s growth, advising clients on their most pressing strategic challenges — from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and new business model design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Consultant in our Zurich/Lausanne office, you will work at the intersection of strategy consulting and data and AI delivery. You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with client leadership teams to address high-stakes questions. How can AI reshape our business model? How should we govern and organise for data? Which strategic programmes deliver the most impact?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured Problem-Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Break complex challenges down into decisions a client can act on, combining consulting rigour with a working knowledge of what current AI can and cannot actually do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn a business question into a solution shape — what data it depends on, what kind of platform or product it should sit on, and what “good” looks like once it is built. You will do this alongside our data scientists and engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Support engagements end to end, from hypothesis framing and market and competitor analysis through to data maturity assessments, client workshops, governance design and implementation roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with C-level stakeholders and business unit leaders. You will build trusted relationships, communicate recommendations with clarity, and keep the work aligned to what the client is actually trying to decide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge &amp;amp; Practice Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to the growth of Artefact&#39;s Zurich office by shaping new offerings, creating intellectual capital - frameworks, thought pieces, benchmarks - and taking part in business development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone who can hold a technical position and a commercial one at the same time. The strongest candidates meet most of the following.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; A degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Data Science, Business, Economics or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Around three to five years in consulting, or in a technical/date-focussed role with client-facing responsibility.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Acumen &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; A genuine dual affinity for business and technology. You are comfortable with modern data and AI concepts - generative AI and LLMs, retrieval, predictive machine learning, cloud platforms - and with what they cost and where they fail, not only with what they are called.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; You have built AI or data products, not only advised on them. You can explain why you chose which model you put on which part of the work, and what that choice did to both output quality and cost. You will not be writing production code in this role, but you should have the basic understanding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Problem-Solving Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong quantitative and analytical skills, and the judgement to know which number actually decides the question. You are comfortable getting to a defensible estimate with your assumptions stated out loud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Interpersonal Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent written and verbal communication. You enjoy working in teams and in front of clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluency in German/French and English, written and spoken, is strongly preferred..&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Eligibility:&lt;/strong&gt; You must be eligible to work in Switzerland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy and the Build:&lt;/strong&gt; Artefact is neither a traditional strategy consultancy nor a pure technology player. You will move between the boardroom and the build, and be expected to be credible in both.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineers, not hand-offs:&lt;/strong&gt; Our 2,500 people include the data scientists and engineers you will work beside on the same engagement - not a delivery organisation you hand a slide deck to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zurich Office Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; As part of a growing Swiss team you will have visibility and impact from the first day. You will help shape Artefact&#39;s footprint in the region and work directly with senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Regular training in both consulting method and AI and data capability, combined with international exposure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture of Doers:&lt;/strong&gt; Innovation, action, collaboration. We are entrepreneurial and fast-moving, committed to delivering impact while supporting each other&#39;s growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is based in &lt;strong&gt;Zürich or Lausanne&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;107&quot; data-end=&quot;126&quot;&gt;Who is Artefact?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;127&quot; data-end=&quot;406&quot;&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in data, digital, and analytics to help clients achieve tangible business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;408&quot; data-end=&quot;795&quot;&gt;With 1,800+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 23 countries, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. Our Romandie office (Geneva/Lausanne) is at the heart of Artefact’s growth, advising clients on their most pressing strategic challenges — from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and new business model design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;797&quot; data-end=&quot;821&quot;&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;822&quot; data-end=&quot;1096&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;827&quot; data-end=&quot;879&quot;&gt;Senior Technical Consultant / Senior AI Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, you will lead the design and delivery of impactful AI and data solutions. You’ll combine hands-on engineering with client advisory, guiding multi-disciplinary teams from opportunity framing to production deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1098&quot; data-end=&quot;2600&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1098&quot; data-end=&quot;1326&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1100&quot; data-end=&quot;1326&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1100&quot; data-end=&quot;1141&quot;&gt;Own solution architecture &amp;amp; delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Define end-to-end architectures (data, ML/LLM, APIs, security), make build/buy decisions, and drive projects from PoC to production with reliability, observability, and cost in mind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1327&quot; data-end=&quot;1512&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1329&quot; data-end=&quot;1512&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1329&quot; data-end=&quot;1360&quot;&gt;Lead complex PoCs &amp;amp; pilots:&lt;/strong&gt; Scope, prototype, and validate AI/ML use cases (incl. LLMs/GenAI, RAG, fine-tuning, evaluation) and convert successful pilots into scalable products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1513&quot; data-end=&quot;1754&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1515&quot; data-end=&quot;1754&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1515&quot; data-end=&quot;1551&quot;&gt;Advanced programming &amp;amp; modeling:&lt;/strong&gt; Build, adapt, and evaluate ML/DL/LLM models using Python (PyTorch, TensorFlow, HuggingFace, LangChain/LlamaIndex), including prompt engineering, fine-tuning/LoRA, vector search, and safety/guardrails.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1755&quot; data-end=&quot;1927&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1757&quot; data-end=&quot;1927&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1757&quot; data-end=&quot;1782&quot;&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; MLOps/LLMOps:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and operate solutions on Azure, GCP, or AWS (CI/CD, containers, model serving, feature stores, vector DBs, monitoring, eval pipelines).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1928&quot; data-end=&quot;2127&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1930&quot; data-end=&quot;2127&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1930&quot; data-end=&quot;1975&quot;&gt;Client advisory &amp;amp; stakeholder management:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate business goals into technical roadmaps, present to senior stakeholders, manage risks and trade-offs, and ensure measurable business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2128&quot; data-end=&quot;2265&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2130&quot; data-end=&quot;2265&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2130&quot; data-end=&quot;2165&quot;&gt;Quality, security &amp;amp; governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Enforce best practices on data privacy, model risk management, responsible AI, and documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2266&quot; data-end=&quot;2425&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2268&quot; data-end=&quot;2425&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2268&quot; data-end=&quot;2300&quot;&gt;Team leadership &amp;amp; mentoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Coach engineers/consultants, perform code and design reviews, and help shape delivery standards and reusable accelerators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2426&quot; data-end=&quot;2600&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2428&quot; data-end=&quot;2600&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2428&quot; data-end=&quot;2463&quot;&gt;Pre-sales &amp;amp; thought leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Support proposals, estimates, and statements of work; contribute to assets, talks, and publications that advance Artefact’s AI offering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;2602&quot; data-end=&quot;2622&quot;&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2623&quot; data-end=&quot;2715&quot;&gt;Engineer first, consultant second — with a builder’s mindset and a track record of shipping.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2717&quot; data-end=&quot;3945&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2717&quot; data-end=&quot;2874&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2719&quot; data-end=&quot;2874&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2719&quot; data-end=&quot;2734&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5–8+ years in data/ML/AI engineering or adjacent roles, including &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2801&quot; data-end=&quot;2849&quot;&gt;end-to-end delivery of production AI systems&lt;/strong&gt; (not just prototypes).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2875&quot; data-end=&quot;3010&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2877&quot; data-end=&quot;3010&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2877&quot; data-end=&quot;2893&quot;&gt;Programming:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert Python; solid software engineering (testing, packaging, CI/CD). SQL required; Java/Scala/TypeScript a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3011&quot; data-end=&quot;3145&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3013&quot; data-end=&quot;3145&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3013&quot; data-end=&quot;3023&quot;&gt;AI/ML:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on with ML/DL and &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3048&quot; data-end=&quot;3056&quot;&gt;LLMs&lt;/strong&gt; (prompting, fine-tuning/LoRA, embeddings/RAG, evaluation &amp;amp; observability, guardrails).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3146&quot; data-end=&quot;3266&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3148&quot; data-end=&quot;3266&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3148&quot; data-end=&quot;3158&quot;&gt;Cloud:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep experience on &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3178&quot; data-end=&quot;3194&quot;&gt;at least one&lt;/strong&gt; major cloud (Azure, GCP, or AWS) deploying secure, scalable services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3267&quot; data-end=&quot;3504&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3269&quot; data-end=&quot;3504&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3269&quot; data-end=&quot;3286&quot;&gt;MLOps/LLMOps:&lt;/strong&gt; Containers (Docker/Kubernetes), Git, pipelines (e.g., GitHub Actions/Cloud-native), model serving (FastAPI/TorchServe/Triton), experiment tracking, model registry, vector DBs (FAISS, Pinecone, pgvector, OpenSearch).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3505&quot; data-end=&quot;3640&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3507&quot; data-end=&quot;3640&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3507&quot; data-end=&quot;3531&quot;&gt;Architecture &amp;amp; data:&lt;/strong&gt; Designing data/ML platforms, APIs, microservices; familiarity with data pipelines and streaming is valued.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3641&quot; data-end=&quot;3761&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3643&quot; data-end=&quot;3761&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3643&quot; data-end=&quot;3665&quot;&gt;Consulting skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Requirements gathering, storytelling, senior stakeholder management, and clear documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3762&quot; data-end=&quot;3876&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3764&quot; data-end=&quot;3876&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3764&quot; data-end=&quot;3778&quot;&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3779&quot; data-end=&quot;3812&quot;&gt;Fluency in French and English&lt;/strong&gt; (written &amp;amp; spoken).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3877&quot; data-end=&quot;3945&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3879&quot; data-end=&quot;3945&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3879&quot; data-end=&quot;3900&quot;&gt;Work eligibility:&lt;/strong&gt; You must be eligible to work in Switzerland.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3947&quot; data-end=&quot;3963&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3947&quot; data-end=&quot;3963&quot;&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3964&quot; data-end=&quot;4225&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3964&quot; data-end=&quot;4062&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3966&quot; data-end=&quot;4062&quot;&gt;Experience with responsible AI/governance frameworks, security reviews, and cost optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;4063&quot; data-end=&quot;4158&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4065&quot; data-end=&quot;4158&quot;&gt;Domain experience in one or more industries (e.g., retail, pharma, manufacturing, finance).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;4159&quot; data-end=&quot;4225&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4161&quot; data-end=&quot;4225&quot;&gt;Contributions to open-source, publications, or conference talks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;4227&quot; data-end=&quot;4241&quot;&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;4242&quot; data-end=&quot;4752&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;4242&quot; data-end=&quot;4359&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4244&quot; data-end=&quot;4359&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4244&quot; data-end=&quot;4274&quot;&gt;Strategy with a Data Edge:&lt;/strong&gt; Operate at the intersection of boardroom strategy and cutting-edge AI engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;4360&quot; data-end=&quot;4494&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4362&quot; data-end=&quot;4494&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4362&quot; data-end=&quot;4389&quot;&gt;Romandie Office Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; High visibility from day one; help shape our Swiss footprint and work directly with senior leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;4495&quot; data-end=&quot;4630&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4497&quot; data-end=&quot;4630&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4497&quot; data-end=&quot;4519&quot;&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced training across strategy, AI/ML/LLM, and cloud; international missions and communities of practice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;4631&quot; data-end=&quot;4752&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4633&quot; data-end=&quot;4752&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4633&quot; data-end=&quot;4654&quot;&gt;Culture of Doers:&lt;/strong&gt; Innovation, action, collaboration. We move fast, deliver impact, and support each other’s growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4754&quot; data-end=&quot;4796&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4754&quot; data-end=&quot;4767&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Lausanne / Geneva (Romandie)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;4798&quot; data-end=&quot;4942&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;If you don’t meet 100% of the criteria, we still want to hear from you. Passion, curiosity, and impact orientation matter — tell us about yours.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;Who is Artefact?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming organisations through data and AI. We combine the rigour of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in data, digital and analytics to help clients achieve tangible business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With 2,500+ consultants, data scientists and engineers, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange and Sanofi. Our Zurich office is at the heart of Artefact’s growth, advising clients on their most pressing strategic challenges — from AI strategy and governance to digital transformation roadmaps and new business model design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Engagement Manager in our Zurich or Lausanne office, you will work at the intersection of strategy consulting and data and AI delivery. You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with client leadership teams to address high-stakes questions. How can AI reshape our business model? How should we govern and organise for data? Which strategic programmes deliver the most impact?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured Problem-Solving:&lt;/strong&gt; Break complex challenges down into decisions a client can act on, combining consulting rigour with a working knowledge of what current AI can and cannot actually do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn a business question into a solution shape — what data it depends on, what kind of platform or product it should sit on, and what “good” looks like once it is built. You will do this alongside our data scientists and engineers, and you will be accountable for whether the design survives contact with production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Run engagements end to end, from hypothesis framing and market and competitor analysis through to data maturity assessments, client workshops, governance design and implementation roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feasibility &amp;amp; Economics:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the answer to &quot;will this work, and what will it cost&quot;. The evaluation approach, the unit economics per query or per case, and the point at which the business case stops closing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with C-level stakeholders and business unit leaders. You will build trusted relationships, communicate recommendations with clarity, and keep the work aligned to what the client is actually trying to decide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead mixed teams of consultants, data scientists and engineers. You are the person who can tell whether the technical plan is realistic, and the person the client believes when you say that it is.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge &amp;amp; Practice Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to the growth of Artefact&#39;s Zurich and Lausanne offices by shaping new offerings, creating intellectual capital - frameworks, thought pieces, benchmarks - and taking part in business development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for someone who can hold a technical position and a commercial one at the same time, and lead a team through both. The strongest candidates meet most of the following.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; A degree in Computer Science, Engineering, Data Science, Business, Economics or a related field. A strong technical foundation counts for more with us than where you studied.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Five to eight years across consulting and technology delivery, including at least one dedicated AI or data project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Acumen &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong dual affinity for business and technology. You have a deep working understanding of modern data and AI concepts — generative AI and LLMs, retrieval, predictive machine learning, cloud architectures — and of their practical business applications. You are capable of scoping AI use cases and of discussing technical constraints and opportunities confidently with C-level stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; You have owned the technical shape of AI work, not only its business case. You think in terms of enterprise architecture — how a solution fits the existing landscape, what it needs from data and governance, and how it scales from pilot to full rollout — and can defend those choices to technical and commercial stakeholders alike. You will not be writing production code, but you should have been close enough to it to be credible with the engineers with which you will collaborate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Problem-Solving Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong quantitative and analytical skills, and the judgement to know which number actually decides the question. You are comfortable getting to a defensible estimate with your assumptions stated out loud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Interpersonal Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent written and verbal communication. You can take a technical trade-off to a non-technical sponsor without flattening it, and be challenged by an engineer without retreating into abstraction. You enjoy working in teams and in front of clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluency in German/French and English, written and spoken, is strongly preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Eligibility:&lt;/strong&gt; You must be eligible to work in Switzerland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy and the Build:&lt;/strong&gt; Artefact is neither a traditional strategy consultancy nor a pure technology player. You will move between the boardroom and the build, and be expected to be credible in both.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineers, not hand-offs:&lt;/strong&gt; Our 2,500 people include the data scientists and engineers you will work beside on the same engagement - not a delivery organisation you hand a slide deck to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zurich Office Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; As part of a growing Swiss team you will have visibility and impact from the first day. You will help shape Artefact&#39;s footprint in the region and work directly with senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Regular training in both consulting method and AI and data capability, combined with international exposure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture of Doers:&lt;/strong&gt; Innovation, action, collaboration. We are entrepreneurial and fast-moving, committed to delivering impact while supporting each other&#39;s growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is based in &lt;strong&gt;Zürich or Lausanne&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

