&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, or veteran status.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
